          }
        }
      }
    },
    "架子边上一条虚线、一个像素小桶。卡带过了线碎成方块，松手就删。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "架子边上一条虚线、一个像素小桶。卡带过了线碎成方块，松手就删。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A dashed line at the shelf's edge and a small pixel bin. Past the line the card breaks into blocks; let go and it is deleted."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "小时候东西掉进去就再也捡不回来的地方。卡带一侧身，从栅条中间掉下去，扑通一声。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "小时候东西掉进去就再也捡不回来的地方。卡带一侧身，从栅条中间掉下去，扑通一声。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Where things fell and never came back. The card turns on its edge, drops between the bars, and plops."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "卡带、硬币、玩具都在那里失踪过。缝张开，卡带侧身滑进去，垫子一合，扬起一点灰。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "卡带、硬币、玩具都在那里失踪过。缝张开，卡带侧身滑进去，垫子一合，扬起一点灰。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cards, coins and toys have all gone missing there. The seam opens, the card slips in on its edge, the cushions close and a little dust comes up."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "写错的字、画坏的画都是这么没的。橡皮来回几下，把卡带擦成屑。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "写错的字、画坏的画都是这么没的。橡皮来回几下，把卡带擦成屑。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How wrong words and spoilt drawings used to go. A few strokes back and forth rub the card into crumbs."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一把小剪刀，靠近了才张开。咔嚓，从中间剪成两半。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一把小剪刀，靠近了才张开。咔嚓，从中间剪成两半。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A small pair of scissors that opens only as the card comes near. Snip: cut in two down the middle."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "地上的井盖滑开，卡带掉进井里，井盖再滑回来。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "地上的井盖滑开，卡带掉进井里，井盖再滑回来。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The cover in the floor slides aside, the card drops down the shaft, and the cover slides back."
          }
        }
      }
    },
