    "让游戏跑快一些（2×、4×）。这是典藏卡带的功能：点一下看典藏卡带": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "让游戏跑快一些（2×、4×）。这是典藏卡带的功能：点一下看典藏卡带"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Run the game faster (2×, 4×). A Collector’s Cartridge feature: tap to see the cartridges"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "把这个软件此刻的样子整个存下来（即时存档，存进现在用的存档位，和游戏自己的存档无关）": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把这个软件此刻的样子整个存下来（即时存档，存进现在用的存档位，和游戏自己的存档无关）"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep this title exactly as it is now (a save state, kept in the slot in use, separate from the game’s own saves)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "回到现在用的存档位里「保存进度」存下的那一刻；没存过就没有可读的": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "回到现在用的存档位里「保存进度」存下的那一刻；没存过就没有可读的"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Go back to the moment Save state kept in the slot in use; nothing to load until you have saved one"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每个游戏有好几个存档位：保存进度、读取进度用的是选中的那一个。点一下换一个": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个游戏有好几个存档位：保存进度、读取进度用的是选中的那一个。点一下换一个"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each game has several save slots: Save state and Load state use the chosen one. Tap to change it"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一叠便签，用手指或 Apple Pencil 写写画画，两个手指翻页，撕掉、保存成存稿；游戏暂停时能把画面放到纸下面": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一叠便签，用手指或 Apple Pencil 写写画画，两个手指翻页，撕掉、保存成存稿；游戏暂停时能把画面放到纸下面"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A pad of notes: write and draw with a finger or Apple Pencil, turn pages with two fingers, tear off or keep as drafts; with the game paused, its picture can sit under the paper"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "两块屏的亮度，五档": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "两块屏的亮度，五档"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Brightness of both screens, five levels"
          }
        }
      }
    },
