    "两块屏在上，下面按键分三列：左边摇杆和十字键，中间 START、SELECT、HOME，右边小摇杆和 A B X Y": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "两块屏在上，下面按键分三列：左边摇杆和十字键，中间 START、SELECT、HOME，右边小摇杆和 A B X Y"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both screens on top; the buttons below in three columns: stick and D-pad on the left, START, SELECT and HOME in the middle, small stick and A B X Y on the right"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "两块屏在上；L ZL、SELECT 在触摸屏左边，R ZR、小摇杆、START 在右边；摇杆、十字键、HOME、A B X Y 在最下面一排": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "两块屏在上；L ZL、SELECT 在触摸屏左边，R ZR、小摇杆、START 在右边；摇杆、十字键、HOME、A B X Y 在最下面一排"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both screens on top; L ZL and SELECT left of the touch screen, R ZR, small stick and START right of it; stick, D-pad, HOME and A B X Y in the bottom row"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "两块屏在中间，左边 L ZL、摇杆、十字键，右边 ZR R、A B X Y、START SELECT HOME，左右对齐；Duo 半折时一页一块屏": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "两块屏在中间，左边 L ZL、摇杆、十字键，右边 ZR R、A B X Y、START SELECT HOME，左右对齐；Duo 半折时一页一块屏"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both screens in the middle; L ZL, stick and D-pad on the left, ZR R, A B X Y and START SELECT HOME on the right, aligned; one screen per page when the Duo is half folded"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "肩键在两块屏中间的铰链上，按键像掌机下半那样摆": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "肩键在两块屏中间的铰链上，按键像掌机下半那样摆"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The shoulder buttons sit on the hinge between the two screens; the buttons are laid out like the handheld’s lower half"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "和经典一样的摆法，A B X Y 大一号": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "和经典一样的摆法，A B X Y 大一号"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Classic layout with A B X Y one size larger"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "两块屏在中间，SELECT HOME START 在触摸屏下面，两边是摇杆、十字键和 A B X Y；接着电视时只留触摸屏；Duo 半折时一页一块屏": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "两块屏在中间，SELECT HOME START 在触摸屏下面，两边是摇杆、十字键和 A B X Y；接着电视时只留触摸屏；Duo 半折时一页一块屏"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both screens in the middle, SELECT HOME START under the touch screen, stick, D-pad and A B X Y at the sides; only the touch screen stays when a TV is connected; one screen per page when the Duo is half folded"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "机身同色的圆润按键，L R 挂在触摸屏下沿，底下一排小圆键": {
