    "存储空间不足：这个文件有 %@，设备上的可用空间不够把它复制进游戏库。清理一些空间后再导入。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "存储空间不足：这个文件有 %@，设备上的可用空间不够把它复制进游戏库。清理一些空间后再导入。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not enough storage: this file is %@ and the device lacks the space to copy it into the library. Free some space and import again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这个文件的内容不是 3DS 游戏（开头没有 NCSD / NCCH / 3DSX / ELF 标记），可能没下载完整，或者已经损坏。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个文件的内容不是 3DS 游戏（开头没有 NCSD / NCCH / 3DSX / ELF 标记），可能没下载完整，或者已经损坏。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This file is not a 3DS game (no NCSD / NCCH / 3DSX / ELF marker at the start); it may be incomplete or damaged."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这个文件带加密保护，没有导入。Zero EMU 只接受不带加密保护的文件，也不提供去除保护的办法。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个文件带加密保护，没有导入。Zero EMU 只接受不带加密保护的文件，也不提供去除保护的办法。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This file has encryption protection, so it was not imported. Zero EMU accepts only files without encryption protection and offers no way to remove it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这个文件已经在游戏库里了。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个文件已经在游戏库里了。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This file is already in the library."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "找不到原文件，请重新选择。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "找不到原文件，请重新选择。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The original file can’t be found; choose it again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这个 CIA 安装包里没有能直接运行的程序（可能是更新或追加内容，或者文件不完整），导入不了。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个 CIA 安装包里没有能直接运行的程序（可能是更新或追加内容，或者文件不完整），导入不了。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This CIA package holds no program that can run by itself (it may be an update or add-on content, or the file is incomplete), so it can’t be imported."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这个压缩文件打不开，或者里面不是能压缩着运行的游戏（能导入的是 .zcci / .zcxi / .z3dsx），导入不了。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个压缩文件打不开，或者里面不是能压缩着运行的游戏（能导入的是 .zcci / .zcxi / .z3dsx），导入不了。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This compressed file can’t be opened, or what is inside can’t run compressed (.zcci / .zcxi / .z3dsx can be imported), so it can’t be imported."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这是 .zip 压缩包，游戏在它里面。先在「文件」App 里点一下它解压，再导入解压出来的 .3ds 或 .cci。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是 .zip 压缩包，游戏在它里面。先在「文件」App 里点一下它解压，再导入解压出来的 .3ds 或 .cci。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is a .zip archive with the game inside. Tap it in the Files app to unzip it first, then import the .3ds or .cci that comes out."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这是 .%@ 压缩包，游戏在它里面。先把里面的 .3ds 或 .cci 解压出来，再导入。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是 .%@ 压缩包，游戏在它里面。先把里面的 .3ds 或 .cci 解压出来，再导入。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
