    "每个像素方方正正，和原机的屏一样清楚。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个像素方方正正，和原机的屏一样清楚。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every pixel square and crisp, like the original screen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "把像素的边抹平一点，放大很多时不那么颗粒。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把像素的边抹平一点，放大很多时不那么颗粒。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pixel edges smoothed a little; less grainy when enlarged a lot."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每行像素之间一条暗线，像老式显示器。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每行像素之间一条暗线，像老式显示器。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A dark line between pixel rows, like an old monitor."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每个像素四周一圈细缝，像凑近了看掌机的液晶屏。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个像素四周一圈细缝，像凑近了看掌机的液晶屏。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A thin gap around each pixel, like the handheld’s LCD seen up close."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "扫描线、边角变暗、颜色浓一点，像显像管电视。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
