            "value": "The software hit an error and stopped"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "模拟的处理器在这个软件里遇到了无法继续的错误。可以关闭软件后重新打开；每次都在同一个地方出错的话，可能是 Zero EMU 的模拟还不支持它。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模拟的处理器在这个软件里遇到了无法继续的错误。可以关闭软件后重新打开；每次都在同一个地方出错的话，可能是 Zero EMU 的模拟还不支持它。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The emulated processor hit an error it could not get past in this software. Close it and open it again; if it fails at the same place every time, Zero EMU’s emulation may not support it yet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这个软件报告了一个无法继续的错误。可以关闭软件后重新打开。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个软件报告了一个无法继续的错误。可以关闭软件后重新打开。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The software reported an error it cannot get past. Close it and open it again."
