            "value": "Under this sheet: the lower screen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在下屏的便签上写字画画；两个手指往上推（触控板上两指往上滑也行），这一张翻过去，往下拉翻回来；「新的一张」（A）直接翻到新的一页。「截屏」（或 SELECT）把暂停的软件的画面放到这一张下面。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在下屏的便签上写字画画；两个手指往上推（触控板上两指往上滑也行），这一张翻过去，往下拉翻回来；「新的一张」（A）直接翻到新的一页。「截屏」（或 SELECT）把暂停的软件的画面放到这一张下面。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Write and draw on the pad on the lower screen. Push up with two fingers (or two fingers up on a trackpad) to turn this sheet over; pull down to turn back; New Sheet (A) goes straight to a fresh page. Capture (or SELECT) puts the paused software’s picture under this sheet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在下屏的便签上写字画画；两个手指往上推（触控板上两指往上滑也行），这一张翻过去，往下拉翻回来；「新的一张」（A）直接翻到新的一页。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在下屏的便签上写字画画；两个手指往上推（触控板上两指往上滑也行），这一张翻过去，往下拉翻回来；「新的一张」（A）直接翻到新的一页。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Write and draw on the pad on the lower screen. Push up with two fingers (or two fingers up on a trackpad) to turn this sheet over; pull down to turn back; New Sheet (A) goes straight to a fresh page."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "L / R 翻页，X 撕掉，十字键左右换笔、上开更多颜色、下拿橡皮，Y 撤销，START 保存进存稿。便签左上角的「照片」把相册里的一张照片放到上屏，对着它写。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L / R 翻页，X 撕掉，十字键左右换笔、上开更多颜色、下拿橡皮，Y 撤销，START 保存进存稿。便签左上角的「照片」把相册里的一张照片放到上屏，对着它写。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L / R turn pages, X tears off; D-pad left/right changes pen, up opens more colours, down takes the eraser; Y undoes, START saves to the drafts. Photo at the pad’s top left puts a picture from the album on the upper screen to write against."
          }
        }
      }
    },
