    "iPhone 就是掌机：上下两半对着两块屏，折痕当铰链。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone 就是掌机：上下两半对着两块屏，折痕当铰链。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The iPhone is the handheld: the two halves are the two screens, the crease is the hinge."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "整台掌机摆在屏幕上。拖动铰链开合上盖，合上就休眠。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "整台掌机摆在屏幕上。拖动铰链开合上盖，合上就休眠。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The whole handheld sits on the screen. Drag the hinge to open or close the lid; closed, it sleeps."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "画面在上，所有按键放大排在下面，小屏 iPhone 也好按。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "画面在上，所有按键放大排在下面，小屏 iPhone 也好按。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The picture on top, all the buttons enlarged below — easy to press on a small iPhone too."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "电视上放游戏画面（装在你选的电视里），iPhone 拿在手里当手柄：按键和下屏都在 iPhone 上。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "电视上放游戏画面（装在你选的电视里），iPhone 拿在手里当手柄：按键和下屏都在 iPhone 上。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The game on the TV (inside the TV set you choose); the iPhone in your hands is the controller, with the buttons and the lower screen on it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "接上外置手柄，整块屏幕只放游戏的两块屏，没有机身和按键；用手柄玩，手柄的 HOME 打开主菜单。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "接上外置手柄，整块屏幕只放游戏的两块屏，没有机身和按键；用手柄玩，手柄的 HOME 打开主菜单。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With a controller connected, the whole screen is just the game’s two screens — no body, no buttons; play with the controller, its HOME opens the menu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
