    "推上去，星空分成红蓝两层：戴红蓝眼镜能看到深度；拉到底是 OFF": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "推上去，星空分成红蓝两层：戴红蓝眼镜能看到深度；拉到底是 OFF"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Push it up and the starfield splits into red and blue layers: with red-cyan glasses you see depth; all the way down is OFF"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按住它，或者对着 iPhone 的麦克风吹气：把飞船吹向上方": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按住它，或者对着 iPhone 的麦克风吹气：把飞船吹向上方"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hold it, or blow on the iPhone’s microphone: the ship is pushed upward"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "铰链（桌面模式）": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
