            "state": "translated",
            "value": "铰链（桌面模式）"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hinge (tabletop mode)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拖动开合上盖，轻点在打开和微合之间切换；合到底就休眠，从下沿往上推打开": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖动开合上盖，轻点在打开和微合之间切换；合到底就休眠，从下沿往上推打开"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drag to open or close the lid, tap to switch between open and slightly closed; fully closed it sleeps — push up from the bottom edge to open"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "方向输入；摇杆是模拟的，推得越远输入越大": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "方向输入；摇杆是模拟的，推得越远输入越大"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Directional input; the stick is analogue — the further you push, the stronger the input"
          }
        }
      }
    },
