    "右边的第二个摇杆，做什么由软件决定": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "右边的第二个摇杆，做什么由软件决定"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The second stick, on the right; what it does is up to the software"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "软件自己的菜单与功能键": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "软件自己的菜单与功能键"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The software’s own menu and function buttons"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "暂停并打开主菜单（和游戏库里掌机上的是同一个）：第一个图标是正在玩的软件，继续游戏或关闭软件；上面一排小图标是保存进度、读取进度、游戏笔记、屏幕亮度；相机、相册、设置、游戏记录、主题、说明书、游玩模式暂停时也能开，HOME 回来（导入在游戏库里）；游戏笔记能把暂停的画面放到纸上": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "暂停并打开主菜单（和游戏库里掌机上的是同一个）：第一个图标是正在玩的软件，继续游戏或关闭软件；上面一排小图标是保存进度、读取进度、游戏笔记、屏幕亮度；相机、相册、设置、游戏记录、主题、说明书、游玩模式暂停时也能开，HOME 回来（导入在游戏库里）；游戏笔记能把暂停的画面放到纸上"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pauses and opens the HOME Menu (the same one as on the handheld in the library): the first icon is the running software — continue or close it; the small icons above are Save state, Load state, Game Notes and Brightness; Camera, Album, Settings, Activity Log, Themes, Manual and Play Modes open while paused too, HOME comes back (Import is in the library); Game Notes can put the paused picture on the paper"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "保存进度（即时存档）并回到游戏库，按一下就走；下次在游戏库里「继续上次」接着玩。不保存就关闭用 HOME 里的「关闭软件」": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保存进度（即时存档）并回到游戏库，按一下就走；下次在游戏库里「继续上次」接着玩。不保存就关闭用 HOME 里的「关闭软件」"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saves the state and returns to the library in one press; next time, Resume in the library picks it up. To close without saving use Close software in HOME"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "游戏读到的 3D 滑块位置；推上去时画面变成红蓝 3D（戴红蓝眼镜看），拉到底是 OFF": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏读到的 3D 滑块位置；推上去时画面变成红蓝 3D（戴红蓝眼镜看），拉到底是 OFF"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The 3D slider position the game reads; pushed up, the picture turns red-cyan 3D (for red-cyan glasses); all the way down is OFF"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "要吹气的游戏：对着 iPhone 吹气（麦克风在 USB-C 口旁边），或者按住 MIC；游戏开始听的时候，有箭头指着掌机上的 MIC。Zero EMU 只听有没有在吹，不录音": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要吹气的游戏：对着 iPhone 吹气（麦克风在 USB-C 口旁边），或者按住 MIC；游戏开始听的时候，有箭头指着掌机上的 MIC。Zero EMU 只听有没有在吹，不录音"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For games that ask you to blow: blow on the iPhone (the microphone is beside the USB-C port) or hold MIC; when a game starts listening, an arrow points at the handheld’s MIC. Zero EMU only listens for a breath; it records nothing"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拖动开合上盖，轻点在打开和微合之间切换；合到底就休眠": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖动开合上盖，轻点在打开和微合之间切换；合到底就休眠"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drag to open or close the lid, tap to switch between open and slightly closed; fully closed it sleeps"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A B X Y 默认按位置对应（右 A、下 B、上 X、左 Y），可以在 系统设置 › 其他设置 › 手柄 换成按字母（Xbox 手柄上印着 A 的键就是 A），或一个个改；L / R 肩键，ZL / ZR 扳机；左摇杆就是掌机的摇杆，右摇杆就是小摇杆；Menu = START，Options = SELECT；Home 键（系统不占用它时）打开 HOME，再按继续。接上手柄会自动换到手柄模式（两块屏放大，屏幕上不再有按键），拔掉换回原来的模式，也可以在「手柄」里关掉": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A B X Y 默认按位置对应（右 A、下 B、上 X、左 Y），可以在 系统设置 › 其他设置 › 手柄 换成按字母（Xbox 手柄上印着 A 的键就是 A），或一个个改；L / R 肩键，ZL / ZR 扳机；左摇杆就是掌机的摇杆，右摇杆就是小摇杆；Menu = START，Options = SELECT；Home 键（系统不占用它时）打开 HOME，再按继续。接上手柄会自动换到手柄模式（两块屏放大，屏幕上不再有按键），拔掉换回原来的模式，也可以在「手柄」里关掉"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A B X Y map by position by default (right A, bottom B, top X, left Y); switch to by letter (the key printed A on an Xbox controller is A) or change them one by one in System Settings › Other Settings › Controller. L / R are the shoulders, ZL / ZR the triggers; the left stick works the handheld’s stick, the right stick its small stick; Menu = START, Options = SELECT; the Home button (when the system leaves it alone) opens HOME, press again to continue. Connecting a controller switches to Controller mode (both screens enlarged, no on-screen buttons); unplugging switches back — this can be turned off under Controller"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App Store 里现在没有这些项目": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App Store 里现在没有这些项目"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "None of these plans are on the App Store right now"
          }
        }
      }
    },
