    "课间十分钟，跳绳要排队。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "课间十分钟，跳绳要排队。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ten minutes of recess, and a queue for the jump rope."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "一个、两个、三个……谁也别想打断。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "一个、两个、三个……谁也别想打断。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One, two, three… and nobody gets to interrupt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "毽子踢到第十个，上课铃就响了。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "毽子踢到第十个，上课铃就响了。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ten kicks in, and the bell rings for class."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "踢了几个？课本角上用「正」字记着。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "踢了几个？课本角上用「正」字记着。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How many kicks? The tally is in the corner of the schoolbook."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "放学路上，书包一颠一颠的。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "放学路上，书包一颠一颠的。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On the way home, the schoolbag bouncing with every step."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "太阳还没落山，不着急回家。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "太阳还没落山，不着急回家。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The sun is still up: no hurry to get home."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下午第二节课，粉笔灰在光里飘。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下午第二节课，粉笔灰在光里飘。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Second lesson of the afternoon, chalk dust drifting in the light."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "窗外的树一直在晃，谁也没发现你在看。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "窗外的树一直在晃，谁也没发现你在看。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The tree outside keeps swaying, and nobody notices you watching."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "夏天的晚上，电风扇摇着头，电视还开着。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "夏天的晚上，电风扇摇着头，电视还开着。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A summer evening: the fan turning its head, the TV still on."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "凉席、西瓜，和一个不想睡的晚上。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "凉席、西瓜，和一个不想睡的晚上。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A bamboo mat, watermelon, and a night you didn’t want to end."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下雨天出不去，就趴在窗台上数雨点。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下雨天出不去，就趴在窗台上数雨点。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Too rainy to go out, so you lean on the sill and count the drops."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "等雨停了，就出去踩水。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "等雨停了，就出去踩水。"
