      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」的%@会被删除，删掉就找不回来了。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The %2$@ for “%1$@” will be deleted, and can’t be recovered."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "存档同步开着：别的设备上的这一份下次同步时也会删掉（放进 Conflicts）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
