          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Some software only starts in its own region. Automatic follows the software. Takes effect the next time software starts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "主机的时间跟着这台 iPhone，软件读到的也是它。要改，到 iPhone 的「设置 › 通用 › 日期与时间」里改。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主机的时间跟着这台 iPhone，软件读到的也是它。要改，到 iPhone 的「设置 › 通用 › 日期与时间」里改。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The handheld’s clock follows this iPhone, and that is what software reads. To change it, go to the iPhone’s Settings › General › Date & Time."
          }
        }
      }
