            "value": "Too far off; Save will start over."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "推一推掌机的摇杆（或外接手柄的左摇杆），上屏显示它推到了哪里。死区是中间不算数的范围：摇杆回不到正中时调大一点。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "推一推掌机的摇杆（或外接手柄的左摇杆），上屏显示它推到了哪里。死区是中间不算数的范围：摇杆回不到正中时调大一点。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Push the handheld’s stick (or a controller’s left stick); the upper screen shows where it is. The dead zone is the range in the middle that doesn’t count: make it larger if the stick doesn’t return to centre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "死区": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "死区"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dead zone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPhone 拨到静音时游戏照样出声，像掌机一样只听左边的 VOL 滑块；想跟着 iPhone 的静音走，就关掉这一项。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone 拨到静音时游戏照样出声，像掌机一样只听左边的 VOL 滑块；想跟着 iPhone 的静音走，就关掉这一项。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With the iPhone switched to silent, games still play — like a handheld, only the VOL slider on the left counts; turn this off to follow the iPhone’s silent switch."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPhone 拨到静音时游戏不出声，和 iPhone 的铃声一样。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone 拨到静音时游戏不出声，和 iPhone 的铃声一样。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "With the iPhone switched to silent, games are silent, like the iPhone’s ringer."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "别的 App 在放音乐时「%@」：%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "别的 App 在放音乐时「%@」：%@"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When another app plays music, “%@”: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "音量就是 iPhone 的音量：掌机左边的 VOL 滑块和 iPhone 的音量键调的是同一个。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "音量就是 iPhone 的音量：掌机左边的 VOL 滑块和 iPhone 的音量键调的是同一个。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The volume is the iPhone’s volume: the VOL slider on the handheld’s left and the iPhone’s volume buttons set the same thing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "音量用掌机左边的 VOL 滑块，或者 iPhone 的音量键。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
