    },
    "这里没有麦克风：按住掌机上的 MIC，主机就收到一阵吹气的声音，要吹气的软件用它。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这里没有麦克风：按住掌机上的 MIC，主机就收到一阵吹气的声音，要吹气的软件用它。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No microphone here: hold the handheld’s MIC and the handheld hears a puff of breath, for software that asks you to blow."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "对着 iPhone 吹气（箭头指着掌机上的 MIC；iPhone 的麦克风在 USB-C 口旁边），或者按住 MIC 孔，主机都收到一阵吹气的声音。Zero EMU 只听有没有在吹，不录音。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "对着 iPhone 吹气（箭头指着掌机上的 MIC；iPhone 的麦克风在 USB-C 口旁边），或者按住 MIC 孔，主机都收到一阵吹气的声音。Zero EMU 只听有没有在吹，不录音。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Blow on the iPhone (the arrow points at the handheld’s MIC; the iPhone’s microphone is beside the USB-C port) or hold the MIC hole: either way the handheld hears a puff of breath. Zero EMU only listens for a breath; it records nothing."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "家长控制限制了 3D 影像：滑块推不上去。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "家长控制限制了 3D 影像：滑块推不上去。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Parental Controls restrict 3D images: the slider won’t go up."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "推一推上屏右边的 3D 滑块，上屏的测试图分成红蓝两层。戴红蓝眼镜看，离得越远的越靠后。拉到底是 2D。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "推一推上屏右边的 3D 滑块，上屏的测试图分成红蓝两层。戴红蓝眼镜看，离得越远的越靠后。拉到底是 2D。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Push the 3D slider to the right of the upper screen and its test picture splits into red and blue layers. With red-cyan glasses, farther things sit farther back. All the way down is 2D."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开着时：两块屏的亮度最高 75%；游戏用复古 1× 分辨率（下次开启时生效），GPU 少算很多。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开着时：两块屏的亮度最高 75%；游戏用复古 1× 分辨率（下次开启时生效），GPU 少算很多。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on: both screens cap at 75% brightness; games use retro 1× resolution (from the next start), which is much less work for the GPU."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "省电模式开着：最亮也只有 75%。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "省电模式开着：最亮也只有 75%。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Power Saving is on: the brightest is 75%."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "渲染器": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
