    "像素原尺寸显示": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "像素原尺寸显示"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pixel-exact display"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vulkan 经 MoltenVK 跑在 Metal 上，不能用时自动改用软件渲染。复古 1× 是原机的 400×240，最省电。像素原尺寸：按整数倍放大，画面小一圈但每个像素方正。下次开启软件时生效。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vulkan 经 MoltenVK 跑在 Metal 上，不能用时自动改用软件渲染。复古 1× 是原机的 400×240，最省电。像素原尺寸：按整数倍放大，画面小一圈但每个像素方正。下次开启软件时生效。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Vulkan runs on Metal through MoltenVK; when it can’t, software rendering takes over. Retro 1× is the original 400×240 and the easiest on the battery. Pixel-exact: enlarged by whole numbers — a little smaller, but every pixel square. Takes effect the next time software starts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "软件渲染只有原生分辨率，最稳但最慢。像素原尺寸：按整数倍放大，每个像素方正。下次开启软件时生效。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "软件渲染只有原生分辨率，最稳但最慢。像素原尺寸：按整数倍放大，每个像素方正。下次开启软件时生效。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Software rendering is native resolution only — the steadiest but the slowest. Pixel-exact: enlarged by whole numbers, every pixel square. Takes effect the next time software starts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "省电模式开着：游戏会用复古 1×。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
