    "掌机的每个键按下、松开时 iPhone 震一下，像按到真的键。模拟器里感觉不到。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "掌机的每个键按下、松开时 iPhone 震一下，像按到真的键。模拟器里感觉不到。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The iPhone taps when a handheld key goes down and up, like a real key. Not felt in the Simulator."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "滤镜只盖在游戏画面上（主菜单和设置不变），换了马上生效，电视上也一样。一个像素在屏幕上小于一个点时，线条会自动变淡。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "滤镜只盖在游戏画面上（主菜单和设置不变），换了马上生效，电视上也一样。一个像素在屏幕上小于一个点时，线条会自动变淡。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The filter covers only the game’s picture (not the HOME Menu or Settings), takes effect at once, and shows on the TV too. When a pixel is smaller than a point on screen, the lines fade by themselves."
          }
        }
      }
    },
