    "同步的：游戏自己的存档（模拟 SD 卡里的存档和附加数据）和 HOME 里「保存进度」存的即时存档。不同步：游戏本体、装进模拟 SD 卡的软件、离开时自动存的继续进度、照片。两边都改过时留新的那份，另一份放进「文件」› Zero EMU › Conflicts。在这里删掉的即时存档，别的设备上同一份也会删掉（放进 Conflicts › Deleted by Sync）；别的存档删了不会跟着删。游戏开着时不同步。某个游戏不想同步：数据管理 › 软件 › 那个游戏。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同步的：游戏自己的存档（模拟 SD 卡里的存档和附加数据）和 HOME 里「保存进度」存的即时存档。不同步：游戏本体、装进模拟 SD 卡的软件、离开时自动存的继续进度、照片。两边都改过时留新的那份，另一份放进「文件」› Zero EMU › Conflicts。在这里删掉的即时存档，别的设备上同一份也会删掉（放进 Conflicts › Deleted by Sync）；别的存档删了不会跟着删。游戏开着时不同步。某个游戏不想同步：数据管理 › 软件 › 那个游戏。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Synced: the games’ own saves (saves and extra data on the emulated SD card) and the save states made with Save state in HOME. Not synced: the games themselves, software installed on the emulated SD card, the resume points saved on leaving, photos. When both sides changed, the newer copy stays and the other goes into Files › Zero EMU › Conflicts. A save state deleted here is deleted on the other devices too (moved into Conflicts › Deleted by Sync); other saves are not deleted to match. No syncing while a game runs. To keep one game out: Data Management › Software › that game."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "App 自己的 iCloud 空间现在用不了：这台 iPhone 要登录 iCloud，并在 设置 › Apple 账户 › iCloud 里允许 Zero EMU 使用 iCloud 云盘。也可以先选 iCloud 云盘里的一个文件夹，一样能同步。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App 自己的 iCloud 空间现在用不了：这台 iPhone 要登录 iCloud，并在 设置 › Apple 账户 › iCloud 里允许 Zero EMU 使用 iCloud 云盘。也可以先选 iCloud 云盘里的一个文件夹，一样能同步。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app’s own iCloud space can’t be used right now: this iPhone must be signed in to iCloud, with Zero EMU allowed to use iCloud Drive under Settings › Apple Account › iCloud. Or choose a folder in iCloud Drive for now: it syncs just as well."
          }
        }
      }
    },
