    "存档位不限个数（典藏卡带）。删除某一个里的进度：系统设置 › 数据管理 › 即时存档。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "存档位不限个数（典藏卡带）。删除某一个里的进度：系统设置 › 数据管理 › 即时存档。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Any number of slots (Collector’s Cartridge). To delete a slot’s state: System Settings › Data Management › Save States."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "前 %lld 个存档位都能用；更多的要典藏卡带（往后再按一下就是典藏卡带的那一页）。删除某一个里的进度：系统设置 › 数据管理 › 即时存档。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "前 %lld 个存档位都能用；更多的要典藏卡带（往后再按一下就是典藏卡带的那一页）。删除某一个里的进度：系统设置 › 数据管理 › 即时存档。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The first %lld slots are free; more need a Collector’s Cartridge (one more press past the last free slot opens the Collector’s Cartridges page). To delete a slot’s state: System Settings › Data Management › Save States."
          }
        }
