    },
    "你有永久了，原来的订阅不会自己停：记得在「管理订阅」里取消，免得继续扣款。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你有永久了，原来的订阅不会自己停：记得在「管理订阅」里取消，免得继续扣款。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You own Lifetime now, but your subscription does not stop by itself: cancel it under Manage Subscription so that you are not charged again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "月付带铜卡带，年付带银卡带，永久带金卡带，三张各放各的动画。月付、年付的卡带跟着订阅：订阅停了，卡带收回去；再订，卡带回来。金卡带一直在。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "月付带铜卡带，年付带银卡带，永久带金卡带，三张各放各的动画。月付、年付的卡带跟着订阅：订阅停了，卡带收回去；再订，卡带回来。金卡带一直在。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Monthly brings the Bronze Cartridge, Yearly the Silver Cartridge and Lifetime the Gold Cartridge; each plays films of its own. The Monthly and Yearly cartridges go with the subscription: when it ends the cartridge is taken back, and it returns when you subscribe again. The Gold Cartridge stays."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "典藏卡带多出来的（铜、银、金都一样）：全部 %lld 种机身配色（免费 %lld 种）、相机的全部 %lld 种机型（免费 %lld 种）、每个游戏不限个数的存档位（免费 %lld 个）、存档同步、TV模式（游戏画面上电视，iPhone 当手柄）、倍速。游戏、存档、备份和别的功能不用典藏卡带。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "典藏卡带多出来的（铜、银、金都一样）：全部 %lld 种机身配色（免费 %lld 种）、相机的全部 %lld 种机型（免费 %lld 种）、每个游戏不限个数的存档位（免费 %lld 个）、存档同步、TV模式（游戏画面上电视，iPhone 当手柄）、倍速。游戏、存档、备份和别的功能不用典藏卡带。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What a Collector’s Cartridge adds (bronze, silver and gold alike): all %lld shell colours (%lld are free), all %lld camera models (%lld are free), any number of save slots per game (%lld are free), Save Sync, TV Mode (the game on the TV, the iPhone as the controller) and Speed. Games, saves, Backup and everything else work without one."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "月付和年付是自动续期的订阅：确认购买时从 Apple 账户扣款，每一期结束前 24 小时内自动续下一期并扣款，除非在那之前取消。取消或换方案：点「管理订阅」，或到 iPhone 的 设置 › Apple 账户 › 订阅。永久是一次买断，不续期。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "月付和年付是自动续期的订阅：确认购买时从 Apple 账户扣款，每一期结束前 24 小时内自动续下一期并扣款，除非在那之前取消。取消或换方案：点「管理订阅」，或到 iPhone 的 设置 › Apple 账户 › 订阅。永久是一次买断，不续期。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Monthly and Yearly are auto-renewing subscriptions: payment is charged to your Apple Account when you confirm the purchase. A subscription renews automatically, charged within the 24 hours before the current period ends, unless you cancel at least 24 hours before the end. To cancel or change plans, tap Manage Subscription, or go to Settings › Apple Account › Subscriptions on your iPhone. Lifetime is a one-time purchase and does not renew."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "调试构建的假商店：点了不扣款，也不连 App Store。在「其他设置 › 开发者」里可以清掉买过的，或换成 App Store。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "调试构建的假商店：点了不扣款，也不连 App Store。在「其他设置 › 开发者」里可以清掉买过的，或换成 App Store。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A debug build’s pretend store: nothing is charged and the App Store is not contacted. Under Other Settings › Developer you can forget what was bought, or switch to the App Store."
          }
        }
      }
    },
