    "2027 年 1 月 1 日（含）以前入手的金卡带，卡带证上有「首发版」的印。编号和日期只记在这台设备上，不会上传到任何地方。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2027 年 1 月 1 日（含）以前入手的金卡带，卡带证上有「首发版」的印。编号和日期只记在这台设备上，不会上传到任何地方。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A Gold Cartridge bought on or before January 1, 2027 carries the Launch Edition stamp on its pass. The number and the date are kept on this device only and are never uploaded."
          }
        }
      }
    },
