        }
      }
    },
    "导出存档：游戏自己的存档和「保存进度」存的即时存档打成一个 zip，用分享面板存进「文件」、发到电脑或 AirDrop 给另一台设备。换手机、重装之前留一份。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "导出存档：游戏自己的存档和「保存进度」存的即时存档打成一个 zip，用分享面板存进「文件」、发到电脑或 AirDrop 给另一台设备。换手机、重装之前留一份。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Export Saves: the games’ own saves and the save states made with Save state go into one zip; the share sheet saves it to Files, sends it to a computer, or AirDrops it to another device. Keep one before changing phones or reinstalling."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从备份恢复：先在「文件」里点一下 zip 解开，再在这里选解开的文件夹。这台设备上没有的存档放回来，一样的不动；不一样的用备份里的，这台设备原来那份先放进「文件」› Zero EMU › Conflicts。什么都不删。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从备份恢复：先在「文件」里点一下 zip 解开，再在这里选解开的文件夹。这台设备上没有的存档放回来，一样的不动；不一样的用备份里的，这台设备原来那份先放进「文件」› Zero EMU › Conflicts。什么都不删。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Restore from Backup: first tap the zip in Files to unzip it, then choose the unzipped folder here. Saves missing on this device come back and identical ones are left alone; where they differ the backup’s copy is used, and this device’s copy goes into Files › Zero EMU › Conflicts first. Nothing is deleted."
          }
        }
      }
    },
