            "value": "Playing on the TV"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "主菜单 ›「游玩模式」› TV模式（在那里选电视；TV模式是典藏卡带的）": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主菜单 ›「游玩模式」› TV模式（在那里选电视；TV模式是典藏卡带的）"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HOME Menu › Play Modes › TV Mode (the TV set is chosen there; TV Mode comes with a Collector’s Cartridge)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TV模式：电视上画一台你选的电视，游戏的上屏装在它的屏幕里（选「现代电视」就不画外壳，画面铺满电视）；iPhone 拿在手里当手柄，按键和下屏都在 iPhone 上。别的模式下接电视，电视上和 iPhone 一模一样（屏幕镜像）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TV模式：电视上画一台你选的电视，游戏的上屏装在它的屏幕里（选「现代电视」就不画外壳，画面铺满电视）；iPhone 拿在手里当手柄，按键和下屏都在 iPhone 上。别的模式下接电视，电视上和 iPhone 一模一样（屏幕镜像）。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TV Mode: the TV shows a TV set of your choice with the game’s upper screen inside its screen (Modern TV draws no casing and fills the picture); the iPhone in your hands is the controller, with the buttons and the lower screen. In the other modes a connected TV shows exactly what the iPhone shows (screen mirroring)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
