      }
    },
    "内置 Azahar 3DS 模拟核心（默认 Vulkan 硬件渲染），运行不带加密保护的游戏与 Homebrew；3D 以红蓝方式呈现，裸眼 3D 尚未实现。Zero EMU 不附带、不下载任何游戏。掌机模型、卡带、主菜单和配色都是 Zero EMU 的原创造型。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "内置 Azahar 3DS 模拟核心（默认 Vulkan 硬件渲染），运行不带加密保护的游戏与 Homebrew；3D 以红蓝方式呈现，裸眼 3D 尚未实现。Zero EMU 不附带、不下载任何游戏。掌机模型、卡带、主菜单和配色都是 Zero EMU 的原创造型。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Built-in Azahar 3DS emulation core (Vulkan hardware rendering by default) for games without encryption protection and homebrew; 3D is shown as red-cyan, glasses-free 3D is not implemented. Zero EMU ships and downloads no games. The handheld model, game cards, HOME Menu and colours are Zero EMU’s own original designs."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这个构建没有附带 3DS 模拟核心：界面、导入与原创演示可用。掌机模型、卡带、主菜单和配色都是 Zero EMU 的原创造型。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个构建没有附带 3DS 模拟核心：界面、导入与原创演示可用。掌机模型、卡带、主菜单和配色都是 Zero EMU 的原创造型。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This build has no 3DS emulation core: the interface, importing and the original demo work. The handheld model, game cards, HOME Menu and colours are Zero EMU’s own original designs."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "支持 .3ds / .cci / .cxi / .app 和 Homebrew .3dsx / .elf（仅限不带加密保护的文件）；也可以在「文件」里选择「用 Zero EMU 打开」。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "支持 .3ds / .cci / .cxi / .app 和 Homebrew .3dsx / .elf（仅限不带加密保护的文件）；也可以在「文件」里选择「用 Zero EMU 打开」。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Supports .3ds / .cci / .cxi / .app and homebrew .3dsx / .elf (files without encryption protection only); you can also choose “Open in Zero EMU” in Files."
          }
        }
      }
    },
