            "value": "Zero EMU User Agreement"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zero EMU 跟着 App Store 更新：有新版本时 App Store 会提示，更新后游戏库、存档和设置都在。即时存档要用同一个版本的核心才读得回来；换了核心版本，「继续上次」会说明原因。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zero EMU 跟着 App Store 更新：有新版本时 App Store 会提示，更新后游戏库、存档和设置都在。即时存档要用同一个版本的核心才读得回来；换了核心版本，「继续上次」会说明原因。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zero EMU updates through the App Store: it tells you when a new version is out, and the library, saves and settings survive the update. Save states load back only on the same core version; after a core change, Resume says why."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "现在的版本": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "现在的版本"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Current version"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "格式化会删除：游戏库里的游戏副本和图标、即时存档和继续进度、主机存储（SD 卡、系统存储、软件自己的存档）、演示的进度、游戏记录，和所有系统设置（用户信息、家长控制、触摸屏、声音、亮度、画面渲染、主题）。「文件」里你自己的原文件不会动；机身配色、音量和 3D 滑块也不变。删掉就找不回来了。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "格式化会删除：游戏库里的游戏副本和图标、即时存档和继续进度、主机存储（SD 卡、系统存储、软件自己的存档）、演示的进度、游戏记录，和所有系统设置（用户信息、家长控制、触摸屏、声音、亮度、画面渲染、主题）。「文件」里你自己的原文件不会动；机身配色、音量和 3D 滑块也不变。删掉就找不回来了。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Formatting deletes: the game copies and icons in the library, save states and resume points, system storage (SD card, system memory, the software’s own saves), the demo’s progress, the activity log, and all system settings (profile, parental controls, touch screen, sound, brightness, rendering, themes). Your own original files in Files are untouched; the shell colour, volume and 3D slider stay too. It can’t be undone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "家长控制限制了删除，不能格式化。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "家长控制限制了删除，不能格式化。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Parental Controls restrict deleting; the system can’t be formatted."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "格式化": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "格式化"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Format"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」正在运行（暂停在主菜单下面）。格式化要先关闭它：按 HOME，在主菜单里选它、「关闭软件」。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」正在运行（暂停在主菜单下面）。格式化要先关闭它：按 HOME，在主菜单里选它、「关闭软件」。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“%@” is running (paused under the HOME Menu). Close it before formatting: press HOME, select it on the menu and choose Close software."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "格式化主机？": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "格式化主机？"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Format the system?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "游戏副本、存档、主机存储和所有设置都会删掉。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏副本、存档、主机存储和所有设置都会删掉。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Game copies, saves, system storage and all settings will be deleted."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "继续": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "继续"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Continue"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "真的要格式化吗？": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "真的要格式化吗？"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Really format?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这是最后一次确认。格式化以后，主机会回到第一次开机的样子。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是最后一次确认。格式化以后，主机会回到第一次开机的样子。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is the last confirmation. After formatting, the handheld is as it was at its first start."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这台主机第一次开机。先设几样：语言、时间、你的名字、生日、国家/地区，一分钟就好。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这台主机第一次开机。先设几样：语言、时间、你的名字、生日、国家/地区，一分钟就好。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This handheld is starting for the first time. A few things to set — language, time, your name, birthday, country/region — it takes a minute."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "点「完成」，主机就设好了。这些以后都能在「系统设置 › 其他设置」里改。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点「完成」，主机就设好了。这些以后都能在「系统设置 › 其他设置」里改。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap Done and the handheld is set up. All of this can be changed later under System Settings › Other Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "最多 10 个字": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最多 10 个字"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Up to 10 characters"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "主机的设置。用十字键选，A 打开，B 返回；也可以直接点下屏。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主机的设置。用十字键选，A 打开，B 返回；也可以直接点下屏。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The handheld’s settings. Choose with the D-pad, A opens, B goes back; or just tap the lower screen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "第 %lld 页，共 %lld 页。用 L / R 或下屏的箭头翻页。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
