    "点三个目标做校正；下面的空白处可以试一试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点三个目标做校正；下面的空白处可以试一试。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tap three targets to calibrate; try it in the blank area below."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "用手指（或触控笔）点准红色十字的中心。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用手指（或触控笔）点准红色十字的中心。"
