    },
    "使用 Zero EMU 的条件。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用 Zero EMU 的条件。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The terms for using Zero EMU."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "接上电视：控制中心 ›「屏幕镜像」选 Apple TV 或支持 AirPlay 的电视，或用转接线接 HDMI。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "接上电视：控制中心 ›「屏幕镜像」选 Apple TV 或支持 AirPlay 的电视，或用转接线接 HDMI。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connect a TV: Control Centre › Screen Mirroring, choose an Apple TV or an AirPlay TV, or use an HDMI adapter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "选一种玩法。在游戏里换马上生效；在游戏库里换，下次开始游戏时用。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
