            "value": "用来显示时间和日期的习惯。主机区域保持「自动」，跟着软件。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sets how times and dates are shown. The system region stays Automatic, following the software."
          }
        }
      }
    },
