    "游戏库": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏库"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Library"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开机": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开机"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Starting up"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "第一次开机先做初始设置（语言、日期和时间、用户名、生日、国家/地区）。设好以后，掌机里插着卡带时打开 Zero EMU 会直接进那个软件；没插卡带（或没插到底）就停在游戏库。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "第一次开机先做初始设置（语言、日期和时间、用户名、生日、国家/地区）。设好以后，掌机里插着卡带时打开 Zero EMU 会直接进那个软件；没插卡带（或没插到底）就停在游戏库。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The first start runs the initial setup (language, date and time, user name, birthday, country/region). After that, opening Zero EMU with a card in the handheld goes straight into that software; with no card (or one not pushed in) it stays in the library."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "挑卡带": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "挑卡带"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Picking a card"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在下面的架子上左右滑动，或点两边的卡带；中间那张面对你，它背后的光是它标签的颜色。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在下面的架子上左右滑动，或点两边的卡带；中间那张面对你，它背后的光是它标签的颜色。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Swipe left and right along the shelf below, or tap the cards at the sides; the middle one faces you, lit from behind in its label’s colour."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "插卡带": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "插卡带"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Inserting a card"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "把中间那张往上拖起来，掌机会转到背面、打开卡槽；放到掌机上就插进去，咔嗒一声，掌机转回原来的样子。插着的卡带不在架子上。点卡带上的 ▶，它会自己插进掌机并开启。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把中间那张往上拖起来，掌机会转到背面、打开卡槽；放到掌机上就插进去，咔嗒一声，掌机转回原来的样子。插着的卡带不在架子上。点卡带上的 ▶，它会自己插进掌机并开启。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drag the middle card up: the handheld turns to its back and opens the card slot; put the card on it and it slides in with a click, and the handheld turns back. An inserted card is not on the shelf. Tap ▶ on a card and it inserts itself and starts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "manual.start.title": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Starting a game"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "插好后，掌机下屏主菜单的第一个图标就是这张卡带：点一下选中（上屏显示它），再点一下、点「开启」或按掌机上的 A 键开始。有上次的进度时是「继续上次」和「重新开始」。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "插好后，掌机下屏主菜单的第一个图标就是这张卡带：点一下选中（上屏显示它），再点一下、点「开启」或按掌机上的 A 键开始。有上次的进度时是「继续上次」和「重新开始」。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Once inserted, the first icon on the handheld’s HOME Menu is this card: tap to select it (the upper screen shows it), then tap again, tap Start, or press A on the handheld. With progress from last time it offers Resume and Start over."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拔卡带": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拔卡带"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Removing a card"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "长按掌机翻到背面，按住露出来的卡带往外拉：拉到哪就停在哪，没插到底时掌机读不到它；推回去到底会咔嗒一声接上。拉出来以后放到架子上；轻点卡带它会自己出来回到架子上。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "长按掌机翻到背面，按住露出来的卡带往外拉：拉到哪就停在哪，没插到底时掌机读不到它；推回去到底会咔嗒一声接上。拉出来以后放到架子上；轻点卡带它会自己出来回到架子上。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hold on the handheld to turn it over, then hold the exposed card and pull: it stops wherever you leave it, and the handheld can’t read it unless it is all the way in; push it back until it clicks. Pulled out, put it on the shelf; a tap on the card makes it come out and return to the shelf by itself."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "掌机下屏的主菜单一页两排各四个图标：卡带、相机、相册、设置；导入、游戏记录、主题、说明书——「游玩模式」和「画框」在第二页：在下屏左右滑动翻页（或点底栏中间的小圆点，十字键走过一排的头尾也会翻过去）。最上面一排是小图标：游戏笔记、铅笔盒、屏幕亮度、画面滤镜（游戏暂停时前面还有保存进度、读取进度），点一下就开。十字键或摇杆移动选择，A 打开，B 返回。在游戏库里、两指放大进掌机、游戏里按 HOME，看到的都是同一个主菜单；只有「导入」只在游戏库里有（导入的卡带落在游戏库的架子上）。没插卡带时其他的也能用。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "掌机下屏的主菜单一页两排各四个图标：卡带、相机、相册、设置；导入、游戏记录、主题、说明书——「游玩模式」和「画框」在第二页：在下屏左右滑动翻页（或点底栏中间的小圆点，十字键走过一排的头尾也会翻过去）。最上面一排是小图标：游戏笔记、铅笔盒、屏幕亮度、画面滤镜（游戏暂停时前面还有保存进度、读取进度），点一下就开。十字键或摇杆移动选择，A 打开，B 返回。在游戏库里、两指放大进掌机、游戏里按 HOME，看到的都是同一个主菜单；只有「导入」只在游戏库里有（导入的卡带落在游戏库的架子上）。没插卡带时其他的也能用。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The HOME Menu on the handheld’s lower screen has two rows of four icons per page: Game Card, Camera, Album, Settings; Import, Activity Log, Themes, Manual — Play Modes and Picture Frame are on page two: swipe left or right on the lower screen (or tap the dots in the bottom bar; the D-pad also wraps past the end of a row). The top row holds small icons: Game Notes, Pencil Box, Brightness and Screen Filter (with Save state and Load state before them while a game is paused); one tap opens them. The D-pad or stick moves the selection, A opens, B goes back. In the library, zoomed into the handheld with two fingers, or on HOME in a game, it is the same menu; only Import is library-only (imported cards land on the library’s shelf). Everything else works without a card."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "主菜单的「相机」（或点一下掌机的 L、R 肩键）直接在掌机上打开：卡带收起来，掌机放大铺平，上屏是取景，下屏是相机的按钮（手机屏幕小，相机铺满屏幕）。按 L、R 或 A 拍照；下屏可以换内侧（iPhone 前置）/ 外侧（iPhone 后置）相机，选镜头：普通、闪闪（按住 MIC 吹气）、合体（先外侧拍对方、再内侧拍自己）、白日梦、暗处、针孔、不可思议；还有 3 秒 / 10 秒定时、手动调整（胶片、亮度、对比度、锐度）。十字键开关水平仪，B 返回，HOME 回到主菜单。iPhone 的「相机控制」键也能用：相机开着时按下就拍照（音量键、设成相机的操作按钮一样），轻按滑出的小菜单里能换镜头和变焦；相机关了就还给系统。相机开着时合上 iPhone Duo，外屏就是相机的操作台：左边是取景，右手拇指下面是拍照键，取景下面一排镜头；在取景上左右划换镜头，两指捏合放大（也可以点取景上的 1、2、4，用外侧还有 .5；当前那颗是蓝的、写着倍数，横着拿时这排竖着靠在取景挨着拍照键的那一边），「相册」翻看刚拍的；取景下面右边的「切换机型」打开和里面一样的机型菜单（取景下面那排镜头不变），点哪台取景里马上就是它的样子，★ 固定到镜头栏，「收起」关上；最下面一排是老相机的设置——闪光（关、自动、开、防红眼）、白平衡（自动、日光、阴天、白炽灯、荧光灯；设错了光，照片就偏那个颜色）、ISO（自动、100 到 1600：越高越亮、噪点越多）、曝光补偿（±2，半档一级）、日期（印在照片右下角），所有镜头都用，里面的「调整」也有这一排；相机控制键、音量键照样能拍。半开着立起来像帐篷、外屏朝外时，外屏整个是画面，给被拍的人看：点一下画面倒数 3 秒（定时设得更长就按定时）再拍，倒数时再点一下取消。底栏的「机型」（或按 Y）是模拟的老相机：原生、老 CCD、暖金胶卷、即显相纸、一次性胶卷、磁带 DV、银盐黑白、千禧像素、00后梦核、冷蓝 CCD、闪光直拍、正片、褪色老照片、交叉冲印、玩具相机、电影卷、放学路上、微机课、生日那晚、VCD 截图（色调、颗粒、暗角、漏光、日期印、相纸都是 Zero EMU 自己做的，不是哪个牌子的），十字键在卡片间走、A 用、X 固定到镜头栏（最多四台，接在九个镜头后面，再点一下回到原生）、B 返回；L、R（或卡片下面的 − ＋）调这台机型的浓淡：25% 到 150%，100% 是原样，每台各记各的，外屏的机型菜单里也有；机型和镜头叠着用。镜头里的「两联」按两次（两张竖着的半格并排成一张），「四连拍」按四次（四张拼在一张相纸上），拍够了才存进相册；中途按 B 这一张重新拼。照片是 640 × 480 的 JPEG，存在「文件」App 的 我的 iPhone › Zero EMU › Azahar › sdmc › DCIM › 100FOLDA，下屏「相册」里可以看和删除。快门声不受音量滑块影响。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主菜单的「相机」（或点一下掌机的 L、R 肩键）直接在掌机上打开：卡带收起来，掌机放大铺平，上屏是取景，下屏是相机的按钮（手机屏幕小，相机铺满屏幕）。按 L、R 或 A 拍照；下屏可以换内侧（iPhone 前置）/ 外侧（iPhone 后置）相机，选镜头：普通、闪闪（按住 MIC 吹气）、合体（先外侧拍对方、再内侧拍自己）、白日梦、暗处、针孔、不可思议；还有 3 秒 / 10 秒定时、手动调整（胶片、亮度、对比度、锐度）。十字键开关水平仪，B 返回，HOME 回到主菜单。iPhone 的「相机控制」键也能用：相机开着时按下就拍照（音量键、设成相机的操作按钮一样），轻按滑出的小菜单里能换镜头和变焦；相机关了就还给系统。相机开着时合上 iPhone Duo，外屏就是相机的操作台：左边是取景，右手拇指下面是拍照键，取景下面一排镜头；在取景上左右划换镜头，两指捏合放大（也可以点取景上的 1、2、4，用外侧还有 .5；当前那颗是蓝的、写着倍数，横着拿时这排竖着靠在取景挨着拍照键的那一边），「相册」翻看刚拍的；取景下面右边的「切换机型」打开和里面一样的机型菜单（取景下面那排镜头不变），点哪台取景里马上就是它的样子，★ 固定到镜头栏，「收起」关上；最下面一排是老相机的设置——闪光（关、自动、开、防红眼）、白平衡（自动、日光、阴天、白炽灯、荧光灯；设错了光，照片就偏那个颜色）、ISO（自动、100 到 1600：越高越亮、噪点越多）、曝光补偿（±2，半档一级）、日期（印在照片右下角），所有镜头都用，里面的「调整」也有这一排；相机控制键、音量键照样能拍。半开着立起来像帐篷、外屏朝外时，外屏整个是画面，给被拍的人看：点一下画面倒数 3 秒（定时设得更长就按定时）再拍，倒数时再点一下取消。底栏的「机型」（或按 Y）是模拟的老相机：原生、老 CCD、暖金胶卷、即显相纸、一次性胶卷、磁带 DV、银盐黑白、千禧像素、00后梦核、冷蓝 CCD、闪光直拍、正片、褪色老照片、交叉冲印、玩具相机、电影卷、放学路上、微机课、生日那晚、VCD 截图（色调、颗粒、暗角、漏光、日期印、相纸都是 Zero EMU 自己做的，不是哪个牌子的），十字键在卡片间走、A 用、X 固定到镜头栏（最多四台，接在九个镜头后面，再点一下回到原生）、B 返回；L、R（或卡片下面的 − ＋）调这台机型的浓淡：25% 到 150%，100% 是原样，每台各记各的，外屏的机型菜单里也有；机型和镜头叠着用。镜头里的「两联」按两次（两张竖着的半格并排成一张），「四连拍」按四次（四张拼在一张相纸上），拍够了才存进相册；中途按 B 这一张重新拼。照片是 640 × 480 的 JPEG，存在「文件」App 的 我的 iPhone › Zero EMU › Azahar › sdmc › DCIM › 100FOLDA，下屏「相册」里可以看和删除。快门声不受音量滑块影响。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Camera on the HOME Menu (or a tap on the handheld’s L or R shoulder) opens right on the handheld: the cards go away, the handheld enlarges and lies flat, the upper screen is the viewfinder and the lower one holds the camera’s buttons (on a small phone the camera fills the screen). Press L, R or A to shoot; the lower screen switches between the inner (iPhone front) and outer (iPhone back) cameras and picks a lens: Plain, Sparkle (hold MIC and blow), Merge (outer for the other person first, then inner for you), Daydream, Low Light, Pinhole, Mystery; plus a 3 s / 10 s timer and manual adjustments (film, brightness, contrast, sharpness). The D-pad toggles the level, B goes back, HOME returns to the menu. The iPhone’s Camera Control works too: with the camera open, a press shoots (so do the volume buttons and an Action button set to Camera); a light press slides out a small menu for lens and zoom; with the camera closed it goes back to the system. Close the iPhone Duo while the camera is open and the cover screen becomes the camera’s console: the viewfinder on the left, the shutter under your right thumb, a row of lenses under the viewfinder; swipe left or right on the viewfinder to change lens, pinch to zoom (or tap 1, 2, 4 on the viewfinder — .5 too on the outer camera; the current one is blue with its factor, and held sideways the row stands beside the viewfinder next to the shutter), Album to look through what you just took; Switch Model at the bottom right of the viewfinder opens the same model menu as inside (the lens row stays), tap a model and the viewfinder shows its look at once, ★ pins it to the lens bar, Close shuts it; the bottom row holds the old-camera settings — flash (off, auto, on, red-eye), white balance (auto, daylight, cloudy, incandescent, fluorescent; set for the wrong light and the photo takes that cast), ISO (auto, 100 to 1600: higher is brighter and noisier), exposure compensation (±2 in half stops), date (stamped at the bottom right), used by every lens; Adjust inside has the same row; Camera Control and the volume buttons still shoot. Stood half open like a tent with the cover screen facing out, the whole cover screen is the picture for the person being photographed: a tap counts down 3 s (or the timer’s setting if longer) and shoots; tap again during the countdown to cancel. Model in the bottom bar (or Y) is a simulated old camera: Native, Old CCD, Warm Gold Film, Instant Print, Disposable, Tape DV, Silver B&W, Y2K Pixels, Dreamcore, Cool Blue CCD, Direct Flash, Slide Film, Faded Print, Cross Process, Toy Camera, Cine Film, After School, Computer Class, Birthday Night, VCD Still (the tones, grain, vignettes, light leaks, date stamps and papers are all Zero EMU’s own, not any brand’s); the D-pad moves between the cards, A uses one, X pins it to the lens bar (up to four, after the nine lenses; tap again to return to Native), B goes back; L and R (or the − and + under the cards) set how strong this model’s look is, from 25% to 150% — 100% is the look as made, each model keeps its own, and the cover screen’s model menu has it too; models and lenses stack. Of the lenses, Diptych takes two presses (two upright half frames side by side on one picture) and Four-up takes four (four pictures on one sheet of paper); the picture goes to the album when the last is taken, and B on the way starts the sheet again. Photos are 640 × 480 JPEGs kept in the Files app under On My iPhone › Zero EMU › Azahar › sdmc › DCIM › 100FOLDA, and can be viewed and deleted in Album on the lower screen. The shutter sound ignores the volume slider."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "主菜单的「相册」直接打开相机拍的照片（相机里的「相册」是同一个）：下屏翻看，上屏放大，X 或「删除」删掉一张，B 回主菜单。「导入」从 iPhone 的「照片」里挑一张（只有挑的那张会交给 Zero EMU），上屏马上是它被机型冲出来的样子：下屏点机型换一台，L、R 或 − ＋ 调浓淡，「保存」存成相册里的一张新照片（原来那张不动；竖着的照片还是竖着，日期印在侧边），「不保存」就什么都不留。相机拍的照片都在这里（游戏笔记的存稿留在游戏笔记里，不进相册；想放进 iPhone 的「照片」，在存稿里点「存到照片」）。照片放在主机的「SD 卡」文件夹里——iPhone 没有 SD 卡，Zero EMU 用一个文件夹模拟 3DS 的 SD 卡（「文件」› Zero EMU › Azahar › sdmc），游戏自己的存档也在那里，相机里的「SD 卡 · 剩余」说的就是它：按 iPhone 实际还剩的空间和照片的大小算还能拍多少张。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主菜单的「相册」直接打开相机拍的照片（相机里的「相册」是同一个）：下屏翻看，上屏放大，X 或「删除」删掉一张，B 回主菜单。「导入」从 iPhone 的「照片」里挑一张（只有挑的那张会交给 Zero EMU），上屏马上是它被机型冲出来的样子：下屏点机型换一台，L、R 或 − ＋ 调浓淡，「保存」存成相册里的一张新照片（原来那张不动；竖着的照片还是竖着，日期印在侧边），「不保存」就什么都不留。相机拍的照片都在这里（游戏笔记的存稿留在游戏笔记里，不进相册；想放进 iPhone 的「照片」，在存稿里点「存到照片」）。照片放在主机的「SD 卡」文件夹里——iPhone 没有 SD 卡，Zero EMU 用一个文件夹模拟 3DS 的 SD 卡（「文件」› Zero EMU › Azahar › sdmc），游戏自己的存档也在那里，相机里的「SD 卡 · 剩余」说的就是它：按 iPhone 实际还剩的空间和照片的大小算还能拍多少张。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Album on the HOME Menu opens the photos the camera took (the Album inside the camera is the same one): browse on the lower screen, see them large on the upper one, X or Delete removes one, B returns to the menu. Import picks one photo from the iPhone’s Photos (only the one you pick is handed to Zero EMU) and the upper screen at once shows it developed by a model: tap a model on the lower screen to change it, L and R or − and + set the strength, Save keeps it as a new photo in the album (the original is untouched; an upright photo stays upright, with its date along the side), Don’t save keeps nothing. Every camera photo is here (Game Notes drafts stay in Game Notes, not the album; to put one in the iPhone’s Photos, tap Save to Photos in the drafts). Photos live in the handheld’s “SD card” folder — the iPhone has no SD card, so Zero EMU simulates the 3DS’s with a folder (Files › Zero EMU › Azahar › sdmc), where the games’ own saves live too; “SD card · left” in the camera refers to it: how many more shots fit, from the iPhone’s real free space and the size of the photos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "主菜单最上面一排的小图标「游戏笔记」：下屏是一叠便签，用起来就像真的一叠，想记多少张都行。用手指或 Apple Pencil 在翻开的这一张上写字画画（iPhone Duo 支持 USB-C 的 Apple Pencil；笔不分轻重）。左下角是黑笔、红笔、第三支笔和橡皮：点第三支笔打开「更多颜色」，十二种颜色里挑一种；十字键左右换笔，上打开更多颜色，下拿橡皮，Y 撤销。两个手指在纸上往上推（触控板上两指往上滑也行），这一张就翻过去折在上面，下一张露出来；写过的最后一张翻过去，下面就是新的一页（没写字的空白页不留），「新的一张」（A）直接翻到新的一页。两个手指往下拉，折过去的那张翻回来（L / R 也能翻；手机上纸下面有「上一张」「下一张」）。「撕掉」（X）把这一张撕掉扔了，存稿里它的那几份也一起撕掉。写的东西离开这一张就存好，下次打开还停在你翻到的那一张；「保存」（START）把这一张的样子存成一份存稿，留在游戏笔记里（不进相册）。有存稿时便签右上角夹着一个别针，点它打开存稿：一页八张，上屏放大看，「放回便签」（A）把它放回便签本，「存到照片」（Y）把这份存稿的图片存进 iPhone 的「照片」（第一次会问能不能添加，存稿里的还在），「撕掉」（X）撕掉这份存稿。游戏暂停时按 HOME 打开它，「截屏」（或 SELECT）把游戏的上屏、下屏画面放到纸下面，照着画面做记号。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主菜单最上面一排的小图标「游戏笔记」：下屏是一叠便签，用起来就像真的一叠，想记多少张都行。用手指或 Apple Pencil 在翻开的这一张上写字画画（iPhone Duo 支持 USB-C 的 Apple Pencil；笔不分轻重）。左下角是黑笔、红笔、第三支笔和橡皮：点第三支笔打开「更多颜色」，十二种颜色里挑一种；十字键左右换笔，上打开更多颜色，下拿橡皮，Y 撤销。两个手指在纸上往上推（触控板上两指往上滑也行），这一张就翻过去折在上面，下一张露出来；写过的最后一张翻过去，下面就是新的一页（没写字的空白页不留），「新的一张」（A）直接翻到新的一页。两个手指往下拉，折过去的那张翻回来（L / R 也能翻；手机上纸下面有「上一张」「下一张」）。「撕掉」（X）把这一张撕掉扔了，存稿里它的那几份也一起撕掉。写的东西离开这一张就存好，下次打开还停在你翻到的那一张；「保存」（START）把这一张的样子存成一份存稿，留在游戏笔记里（不进相册）。有存稿时便签右上角夹着一个别针，点它打开存稿：一页八张，上屏放大看，「放回便签」（A）把它放回便签本，「存到照片」（Y）把这份存稿的图片存进 iPhone 的「照片」（第一次会问能不能添加，存稿里的还在），「撕掉」（X）撕掉这份存稿。游戏暂停时按 HOME 打开它，「截屏」（或 SELECT）把游戏的上屏、下屏画面放到纸下面，照着画面做记号。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Game Notes, the small icon in the HOME Menu’s top row: the lower screen is a pad of notes that works like a real one, with as many sheets as you like. Write and draw on the open sheet with a finger or Apple Pencil (the iPhone Duo takes the USB-C Apple Pencil; pressure is ignored). At the bottom left are a black pen, a red pen, a third pen and the eraser: tap the third pen to open More colours and pick one of twelve; the D-pad changes pen left and right, opens more colours up, takes the eraser down; Y undoes. Push up on the paper with two fingers (or two fingers up on a trackpad) and this sheet folds over to show the next; turn over the last written sheet and a fresh page is underneath (blank pages are not kept); New Sheet (A) goes straight to a fresh page. Pull down with two fingers to turn a folded sheet back (L / R turn pages too; on a phone there are Previous and Next under the paper). Tear off (X) throws this sheet away, with its copies in the drafts. Writing is saved as you leave a sheet, and the pad opens on the sheet you were at; Save (START) keeps this sheet’s look as a draft inside Game Notes (not the album). With drafts, a pin at the pad’s top right opens them: eight per page, large on the upper screen; Back to the pad (A) returns one to the pad, Save to Photos (Y) puts its picture in the iPhone’s Photos (asking for permission the first time; the draft stays), Tear up (X) removes the draft. With a game paused, open it from HOME: Capture (or SELECT) puts the game’s upper or lower screen under the paper to mark up."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "主菜单的「设置」直接在掌机的两块屏上打开：互联网设置、家长控制、数据管理、TV输出、其他设置（用户信息、日期和时间、手柄、语言、声音、麦克风、触摸屏、摇杆、画面滤镜、3D、省电、亮度、画面渲染、震动、关于本机、格式化），和典藏卡带。十字键或摇杆选，A 确定，B 返回，HOME 回到主菜单。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主菜单的「设置」直接在掌机的两块屏上打开：互联网设置、家长控制、数据管理、TV输出、其他设置（用户信息、日期和时间、手柄、语言、声音、麦克风、触摸屏、摇杆、画面滤镜、3D、省电、亮度、画面渲染、震动、关于本机、格式化），和典藏卡带。十字键或摇杆选，A 确定，B 返回，HOME 回到主菜单。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Settings on the HOME Menu opens right on the handheld’s two screens: Internet Settings, Parental Controls, Data Management, TV Output, Other Settings (profile, date & time, controller, language, sound, microphone, touch screen, stick, screen filter, 3D, power saving, brightness, rendering, haptics, about, format), and Collector’s Cartridges. The D-pad or stick chooses, A confirms, B goes back, HOME returns to the menu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "游戏记录、主题、说明书": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏记录、主题、说明书"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Activity Log, Themes, Manual"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "也在掌机的两块屏上打开：下屏是列表，上屏是选中那一项的详情。游戏记录记每个软件玩了多久（在前台、开着盖的时间才算）；主题换配色：游戏库的纸面，和掌机屏幕上的主菜单、设置这些程序（游戏库里的掌机和游戏里的掌机一样；相机、相册、游戏笔记保持原样）；也换掌机的机身配色（游戏库里的掌机马上换，游戏里的掌机也一样；两种颜色的配色，面板是第二种颜色，铰链、边框和背面是第一种）；说明书就是你正在看的这个。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "也在掌机的两块屏上打开：下屏是列表，上屏是选中那一项的详情。游戏记录记每个软件玩了多久（在前台、开着盖的时间才算）；主题换配色：游戏库的纸面，和掌机屏幕上的主菜单、设置这些程序（游戏库里的掌机和游戏里的掌机一样；相机、相册、游戏笔记保持原样）；也换掌机的机身配色（游戏库里的掌机马上换，游戏里的掌机也一样；两种颜色的配色，面板是第二种颜色，铰链、边框和背面是第一种）；说明书就是你正在看的这个。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These open on the handheld’s two screens too: a list below, the selected item’s details above. The Activity Log records how long each title was played (only in the foreground with the lid open); Themes changes the colours of the library’s paper and of the HOME Menu and programs on the handheld’s screens (the handheld in the library and in a game alike; Camera, Album and Game Notes stay as they are), and the handheld’s shell colour (the library’s handheld changes at once, the in-game one too; in a two-colour scheme the panels take the second colour, the hinge, frame and back the first); the Manual is what you are reading now."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "触控笔": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "触控笔"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stylus"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "掌机背面右边插着触控笔：翻到背面点一下就拔出来拿在手里，再点一下收回去。拿着它的时候，点掌机下屏会看到笔尖点在那里。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "掌机背面右边插着触控笔：翻到背面点一下就拔出来拿在手里，再点一下收回去。拿着它的时候，点掌机下屏会看到笔尖点在那里。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The stylus sits in the right side of the handheld’s back: turn it over and tap to take it in hand, tap again to put it away. While holding it, tapping the handheld’s lower screen shows its tip there."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPhone 接上耳机（有线、USB-C 或蓝牙）时，掌机正面左边的耳机孔会插上一副白色线控耳机；拔掉就空着。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone 接上耳机（有线、USB-C 或蓝牙）时，掌机正面左边的耳机孔会插上一副白色线控耳机；拔掉就空着。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When headphones (wired, USB-C or Bluetooth) are connected to the iPhone, a white pair with an inline remote plugs into the jack on the handheld’s front left; unplug them and it is empty."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "看掌机": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "看掌机"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Looking at the handheld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "拖动旋转，两指缩放（游戏库里任何地方两指都行）。掌机上的按键点了就是按下去：十字键和摇杆移动主菜单的光标，A 打开，B 和 HOME 返回；3D 滑块和音量滑块可以拖。在掌机旁边的空白处连点两下，掌机回到正面。两指放大时下面的卡带跟着变小直到消失，放到最大就进入掌机：掌机铺满屏幕，屏幕上是同一个主菜单；HOME 回到游戏库。放大到哪里，主菜单都照样能点、能打开；打开的程序关掉以后，掌机回到打开前那么大、那个角度。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "拖动旋转，两指缩放（游戏库里任何地方两指都行）。掌机上的按键点了就是按下去：十字键和摇杆移动主菜单的光标，A 打开，B 和 HOME 返回；3D 滑块和音量滑块可以拖。在掌机旁边的空白处连点两下，掌机回到正面。两指放大时下面的卡带跟着变小直到消失，放到最大就进入掌机：掌机铺满屏幕，屏幕上是同一个主菜单；HOME 回到游戏库。放大到哪里，主菜单都照样能点、能打开；打开的程序关掉以后，掌机回到打开前那么大、那个角度。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drag to turn it, pinch to zoom (two fingers anywhere in the library). The handheld’s buttons press when tapped: the D-pad and stick move the HOME Menu cursor, A opens, B and HOME go back; the 3D and volume sliders can be dragged. Double-tap the empty space beside the handheld to bring it back to the front. As you pinch in, the cards below shrink until they vanish; at full size you enter the handheld — it fills the screen with the same HOME Menu; HOME returns to the library. At any zoom the menu can be tapped and opened; when an opened program closes, the handheld returns to the size and angle it had before."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "充电": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "充电"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Charging"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPhone 在充电时，掌机背面的充电口插着充电线，正面的充电灯亮橙色，充满了就灭（线还插着）。在游戏库里插上或拔掉充电器，掌机会转过来让你看到插头插进去或拔出来，再转回去。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone 在充电时，掌机背面的充电口插着充电线，正面的充电灯亮橙色，充满了就灭（线还插着）。在游戏库里插上或拔掉充电器，掌机会转过来让你看到插头插进去或拔出来，再转回去。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "While the iPhone charges, a cable sits in the port on the handheld’s back and the charge light on the front glows orange, going out when full (the cable stays). Plug the charger in or out in the library and the handheld turns to show the plug going in or coming out, then turns back."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上屏左边的 VOL 滑块就是 iPhone 自己的音量：往上大、往下小，按 iPhone 的音量键它跟着动，在 iPhone 上直接拖滑钮就是调系统音量，两边永远是同一个数。iOS 不让软件自己改系统音量，只能用系统的音量滑块，所以 Zero EMU 把系统滑块放在滑钮下面。模拟器里没有系统的音量滑块，那里的 VOL 是 Zero EMU 自己的音量（游戏和掌机的声音），手指照样能拖，按侧面的音量键它也跟着动。按起来上下反了的话，到 iPhone 的 设置 › 声音与触感 关掉“固定位置音量控制”（Fixed Position Volume Controls），按键就跟着方向走。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上屏左边的 VOL 滑块就是 iPhone 自己的音量：往上大、往下小，按 iPhone 的音量键它跟着动，在 iPhone 上直接拖滑钮就是调系统音量，两边永远是同一个数。iOS 不让软件自己改系统音量，只能用系统的音量滑块，所以 Zero EMU 把系统滑块放在滑钮下面。模拟器里没有系统的音量滑块，那里的 VOL 是 Zero EMU 自己的音量（游戏和掌机的声音），手指照样能拖，按侧面的音量键它也跟着动。按起来上下反了的话，到 iPhone 的 设置 › 声音与触感 关掉“固定位置音量控制”（Fixed Position Volume Controls），按键就跟着方向走。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The VOL slider to the left of the upper screen is the iPhone’s own volume: up is louder, down quieter; it follows the iPhone’s volume buttons, and dragging the knob on the iPhone sets the system volume — the two are always the same number. iOS does not let apps change the system volume themselves, only through the system’s slider, so Zero EMU puts that slider under the knob. The Simulator has no system slider; its VOL is Zero EMU’s own volume (game and handheld sounds), draggable all the same, and it follows the side buttons too. If the buttons feel upside down, turn off Fixed Position Volume Controls under the iPhone’s Settings › Sounds & Haptics and they follow the direction."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "游玩模式、TV模式": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游玩模式、TV模式"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Play Modes, TV Mode"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "主菜单的「游玩模式」选怎么玩：掌机模式（iPhone 就是掌机，折痕当铰链）、桌面模式（整台掌机摆在屏幕上，铰链能开合）、手柄模式（画面在上，按键放大排在下面）、TV模式（电视上放游戏画面，iPhone 拿在手里当手柄，按键和下屏都在 iPhone 上）、沉浸模式（接上外置手柄以后，整块屏幕只放游戏的两块屏，没有机身和按键：竖着拿上下各一半，横着拿左右各一半，iPhone Duo 上都不压在折痕上；手柄的 HOME 打开主菜单，点一下屏幕上黑的地方也会出来 HOME 和 POWER；没接手柄选不了，玩着手柄断了先换成手柄模式，连上又回来）。在游戏里换马上生效，在游戏库里换就是下次开始游戏用的模式。TV模式要先接电视：控制中心 ›「屏幕镜像」选 Apple TV 或支持 AirPlay 的电视，或用转接线接 HDMI。「选电视」选电视上画哪台电视：七台旧电视，游戏的上屏装在它的屏幕里，「画面」可以选当年的画面（显像管的扫描线、早期液晶的发虚）或最好的画面；或者现代电视，不画外壳，两块屏怎么摆（上下两屏、左右并排、只显示上屏）也在这里选。没接电视也能先选好；TV模式里 iPhone 上也有「选电视」的按钮。别的模式下接电视，电视上和 iPhone 一模一样（屏幕镜像）。系统设置 › TV输出 看接没接上、怎么接。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主菜单的「游玩模式」选怎么玩：掌机模式（iPhone 就是掌机，折痕当铰链）、桌面模式（整台掌机摆在屏幕上，铰链能开合）、手柄模式（画面在上，按键放大排在下面）、TV模式（电视上放游戏画面，iPhone 拿在手里当手柄，按键和下屏都在 iPhone 上）、沉浸模式（接上外置手柄以后，整块屏幕只放游戏的两块屏，没有机身和按键：竖着拿上下各一半，横着拿左右各一半，iPhone Duo 上都不压在折痕上；手柄的 HOME 打开主菜单，点一下屏幕上黑的地方也会出来 HOME 和 POWER；没接手柄选不了，玩着手柄断了先换成手柄模式，连上又回来）。在游戏里换马上生效，在游戏库里换就是下次开始游戏用的模式。TV模式要先接电视：控制中心 ›「屏幕镜像」选 Apple TV 或支持 AirPlay 的电视，或用转接线接 HDMI。「选电视」选电视上画哪台电视：七台旧电视，游戏的上屏装在它的屏幕里，「画面」可以选当年的画面（显像管的扫描线、早期液晶的发虚）或最好的画面；或者现代电视，不画外壳，两块屏怎么摆（上下两屏、左右并排、只显示上屏）也在这里选。没接电视也能先选好；TV模式里 iPhone 上也有「选电视」的按钮。别的模式下接电视，电视上和 iPhone 一模一样（屏幕镜像）。系统设置 › TV输出 看接没接上、怎么接。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Play Modes on the HOME Menu chooses how to play: Handheld mode (the iPhone is the handheld, the crease its hinge), Tabletop mode (the whole handheld on the screen, hinge opening and closing), Controller mode (picture on top, enlarged buttons below), TV Mode (the game on the TV, the iPhone in your hands as the controller with the buttons and lower screen), Immersive mode (with an external controller connected, the whole screen is just the game’s two screens, no body or buttons: upright they take the top and bottom halves, sideways the left and right, never across the Duo’s crease; the controller’s HOME opens the menu, and a tap on a black area shows HOME and POWER; it can’t be chosen without a controller, and if the controller drops mid-game it switches to Controller mode until the controller is back). Changed in a game it takes effect at once; changed in the library it is the mode the next game starts in. TV Mode needs a TV first: Control Centre › Screen Mirroring, choose an Apple TV or an AirPlay TV, or use an HDMI adapter. Choose TV picks the set drawn on the TV: seven old sets with the game’s upper screen inside their screens, where Picture can be the period picture (CRT scanlines, early LCD softness) or the best picture; or a modern TV with no casing, where the layout of the two screens (stacked, side by side, upper only) is chosen too. It can all be chosen before a TV is connected; in TV Mode the iPhone has a Choose TV button as well. In the other modes a connected TV shows exactly what the iPhone shows (screen mirroring). System Settings › TV Output shows whether a TV is connected and how to connect one."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "主菜单第二页的「画框」：上屏是一幅一直在动的风景，下屏是时间、几幅风景的小图和几个开关。把 iPhone 立在桌上（iPhone Duo 半折着放），它就是一个会动的画框。点小图换风景：「篝火旁的存档点」「黄昏小镇的屋顶」「下雨的电车站」和「云上的飞艇」。风景的光跟着手机的时间走：夜里是星星和灯火，清晨和傍晚天是粉的，白天亮起来；屋顶那一幅里塔上的钟走的是手机的时间，白天整点会敲钟；电车站那一幅每隔几分钟有一趟电车进站，停一会儿再开走，偶尔还会打雷；飞艇在云海上慢慢漂，偶尔有一群鸟飞过。「声音」开着时每幅有自己的声音（柴火、风和风铃、雨声和蛙鸣、高空的风和远远的引擎、虫鸣、鸟叫），音量就是 iPhone 的音量；「早晚的光跟着手机的时间」关掉就一直是夜里；「多久以后熄屏」选了时间，到点两块屏全黑，碰一下屏幕或按任何键亮回来。开着画框时 iPhone 不会自动锁屏（熄屏以后照常）；一会儿没碰，下屏会自己变暗。B 或「返回」回主菜单。不用典藏卡带。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主菜单第二页的「画框」：上屏是一幅一直在动的风景，下屏是时间、几幅风景的小图和几个开关。把 iPhone 立在桌上（iPhone Duo 半折着放），它就是一个会动的画框。点小图换风景：「篝火旁的存档点」「黄昏小镇的屋顶」「下雨的电车站」和「云上的飞艇」。风景的光跟着手机的时间走：夜里是星星和灯火，清晨和傍晚天是粉的，白天亮起来；屋顶那一幅里塔上的钟走的是手机的时间，白天整点会敲钟；电车站那一幅每隔几分钟有一趟电车进站，停一会儿再开走，偶尔还会打雷；飞艇在云海上慢慢漂，偶尔有一群鸟飞过。「声音」开着时每幅有自己的声音（柴火、风和风铃、雨声和蛙鸣、高空的风和远远的引擎、虫鸣、鸟叫），音量就是 iPhone 的音量；「早晚的光跟着手机的时间」关掉就一直是夜里；「多久以后熄屏」选了时间，到点两块屏全黑，碰一下屏幕或按任何键亮回来。开着画框时 iPhone 不会自动锁屏（熄屏以后照常）；一会儿没碰，下屏会自己变暗。B 或「返回」回主菜单。不用典藏卡带。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Picture Frame, on page two of the HOME Menu: a scenery that keeps moving on the upper screen; the time, the sceneries to choose from and a few switches on the lower. Stand the iPhone on a desk (an iPhone Duo half folded) and it is a living picture frame. Tap a scenery to change it: “Save Point by the Campfire”, “Rooftops at Dusk”, “Tram Stop in the Rain” and “Airship above the Clouds”. The scenery’s light follows the iPhone’s clock: stars and lamps at night, a rosy sky at dawn and dusk, daylight by day; in the rooftops the tower’s clock keeps the iPhone’s time, and by day its bell strikes the hours; at the tram stop a tram comes in every few minutes, waits a little and goes on, and now and then there is thunder; the airship drifts slowly over the sea of clouds, and now and then a few birds fly by. With Sound on each scenery has its own sounds (the fire, the wind and a wind chime, the rain and the frogs, the wind up high and a far-off engine, crickets, birds), at the iPhone’s own volume; with “Light follows the iPhone’s clock” off it stays night; with “Go dark after” set, both screens go black after that long — touch the screen or press any key to light them again. While the frame is up the iPhone does not lock itself (once it has gone dark, it does as usual); left alone for a moment, the lower screen dims. B or Back returns to the menu. No Collector’s Cartridge needed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "游戏库右下角的小铅笔盒（主菜单最上面一排也有）：一只老铁皮文具盒。打开以后，上屏是盒盖里面，印着乘法口诀表，旁边是攒到的东西，还没攒到的用铅笔画个框，写着还差几张；下屏是盒子里的托盘，没贴出去的东西放在大格子里，点红布条翻到下一层。点一样东西，可以贴到盒盖上，或放回铅笔盒。底下的「照片」从掌机相册或 iPhone 照片里挑一张贴上（iPhone 照片只拿你选的那几张）；「游戏笔记」挑一页写过的便签贴上；「写便条」用手指或 Apple Pencil 写，也能打字，字是手写体（第一次用时 iPhone 会下载一次这种字体）。打开「外屏用盒盖」，合上手机，外屏就是这只铅笔盒的盒盖：一根手指拖动；两根手指转动、缩放刚碰过的那一样；点一下，八音盒放小曲，照片和便条放大看；按住出菜单（放回铅笔盒、摆正、大一点、小一点）。没有外屏的 iPhone，在桌面模式合上盖子也能看到。卡带架上自己导入的游戏多起来（演示卡不算），盒子里就多一样小东西——1 张：小红花印章，便签里也能盖；3 张：棒棒糖，相册编辑的贴画里也有；5 张：八音盒；8 张：作业本格子纸，便签和便条多一种纸；12 张：自行车、书包、落叶。得到的东西一直留着，删了游戏也不会收回。不用典藏卡带。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏库右下角的小铅笔盒（主菜单最上面一排也有）：一只老铁皮文具盒。打开以后，上屏是盒盖里面，印着乘法口诀表，旁边是攒到的东西，还没攒到的用铅笔画个框，写着还差几张；下屏是盒子里的托盘，没贴出去的东西放在大格子里，点红布条翻到下一层。点一样东西，可以贴到盒盖上，或放回铅笔盒。底下的「照片」从掌机相册或 iPhone 照片里挑一张贴上（iPhone 照片只拿你选的那几张）；「游戏笔记」挑一页写过的便签贴上；「写便条」用手指或 Apple Pencil 写，也能打字，字是手写体（第一次用时 iPhone 会下载一次这种字体）。打开「外屏用盒盖」，合上手机，外屏就是这只铅笔盒的盒盖：一根手指拖动；两根手指转动、缩放刚碰过的那一样；点一下，八音盒放小曲，照片和便条放大看；按住出菜单（放回铅笔盒、摆正、大一点、小一点）。没有外屏的 iPhone，在桌面模式合上盖子也能看到。卡带架上自己导入的游戏多起来（演示卡不算），盒子里就多一样小东西——1 张：小红花印章，便签里也能盖；3 张：棒棒糖，相册编辑的贴画里也有；5 张：八音盒；8 张：作业本格子纸，便签和便条多一种纸；12 张：自行车、书包、落叶。得到的东西一直留着，删了游戏也不会收回。不用典藏卡带。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The little pencil box in the library’s lower right corner (also in the HOME Menu’s top row): an old tin pencil box. Open it and the upper screen is the inside of its lid, the multiplication table printed on it and what you have gathered beside it — what is still to come is drawn round in pencil with how many more games it wants; the lower screen is the tray inside, where what is not on the lid waits in the big well; the red ribbon turns to the next layer. Tap a thing to stick it on the lid, or put it back in the box. Along the foot, Photo puts up a picture from the console’s album or from iPhone Photos (only the photos you choose reach the app); Game Notes puts up a written page of the pad; Write a note lets you write with a finger or Apple Pencil, or type — in a handwriting typeface, which iPhone downloads once the first time. Turn on Lid on the cover and close the phone: the cover is the box’s lid. One finger moves a thing; two fingers turn and size the one touched last; a tap makes the music box play and brings a photo or a note up close; hold for Back in the box, Straighten, Bigger, Smaller. On an iPhone without a cover, close the lid in Tabletop Mode to see it. As games of your own fill the shelf (the demo card does not count), small things come into the box — 1 game: a red flower stamp, which stamps in Sticky Notes too; 3: a lollipop, also a sticker for the Album’s editing; 5: a music box; 8: squared exercise paper, a new paper for Sticky Notes and notes; 12: a bicycle, a school bag and a fallen leaf. What comes stays, even if games leave the shelf. No Collector’s Cartridge needed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "游戏里": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏里"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In a game"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "游戏里按 HOME": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏里按 HOME"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HOME in a Game"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "游戏里按 HOME：游戏暂停，下屏是同一个主菜单，第一个图标是正在玩的软件（「继续游戏」「关闭软件」），上屏是它暂停时的画面。主菜单上面一排小图标：保存进度（把这个软件此刻的样子整个存下来，叫即时存档，和游戏自己的存档无关）、读取进度（回到上次保存进度的那一刻）、存档位（每个游戏有好几个，保存和读取用的是选中的那一个）、游戏笔记、铅笔盒、屏幕亮度。相机、相册、设置、游戏记录、主题、说明书、游玩模式和小图标里的游戏笔记都可以在游戏暂停时直接打开，不换模式，HOME 回到主菜单；只有格式化主机和移除正在玩的软件要先关闭它。导入在游戏库的主菜单里。再按一次 HOME 继续游戏。按 POWER 不进菜单：保存进度（即时存档）后直接回游戏库，掌机带着游戏最后的画面缩回台子上；下次在游戏库里「继续上次」就接着玩。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏里按 HOME：游戏暂停，下屏是同一个主菜单，第一个图标是正在玩的软件（「继续游戏」「关闭软件」），上屏是它暂停时的画面。主菜单上面一排小图标：保存进度（把这个软件此刻的样子整个存下来，叫即时存档，和游戏自己的存档无关）、读取进度（回到上次保存进度的那一刻）、存档位（每个游戏有好几个，保存和读取用的是选中的那一个）、游戏笔记、铅笔盒、屏幕亮度。相机、相册、设置、游戏记录、主题、说明书、游玩模式和小图标里的游戏笔记都可以在游戏暂停时直接打开，不换模式，HOME 回到主菜单；只有格式化主机和移除正在玩的软件要先关闭它。导入在游戏库的主菜单里。再按一次 HOME 继续游戏。按 POWER 不进菜单：保存进度（即时存档）后直接回游戏库，掌机带着游戏最后的画面缩回台子上；下次在游戏库里「继续上次」就接着玩。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Press HOME in a game: the game pauses, the lower screen shows the same HOME Menu with the running software as its first icon (Continue, Close software), and the upper screen shows the game as it paused. The small icons above the menu: Save state (keeps this title exactly as it is now — a save state, separate from the game’s own saves), Load state (back to the moment of the last save), Save Slot (each game has several; saving and loading use the chosen one), Game Notes, Pencil Box, Brightness. Camera, Album, Settings, Activity Log, Themes, Manual, Play Modes and Game Notes all open while the game is paused, without changing mode; HOME returns to the menu. Only formatting the system and removing the running software need it closed first. Import is on the library’s menu. Press HOME again to continue. POWER skips the menu: it saves a state and goes straight back to the library, the handheld shrinking back onto its stand with the game’s last picture; next time, Resume in the library picks it up."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "系统设置 › 其他设置（第 3 页）› 画面滤镜：原样（像素方方正正）、柔和、扫描线、LCD 网格、老电视。只盖在游戏画面上，换了马上生效，电视上也一样。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统设置 › 其他设置（第 3 页）› 画面滤镜：原样（像素方方正正）、柔和、扫描线、LCD 网格、老电视。只盖在游戏画面上，换了马上生效，电视上也一样。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "System Settings › Other Settings (page 3) › Screen filter: As is (square pixels), Soft, Scanlines, LCD grid, Old TV. It covers only the game’s picture, takes effect at once, and shows on the TV too."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "典藏卡带多了什么": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "典藏卡带多了什么"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What a Collector’s Cartridge adds"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "系统设置里的「典藏卡带」：月付带铜卡带，年付带银卡带，一次买断带金卡带。有了任何一张，都多出全部机身配色（免费的是前 %lld 种）、相机的全部机型（免费的是前 %lld 种）、每个游戏不限个数的存档位（免费的是前 %lld 个）、存档同步、TV模式（游戏画面放到电视上，iPhone 当手柄），和游戏里的倍速；带小锁的就是典藏卡带的，点它会带你到那一页。三张卡带各放各的动画：放进掌机、按「开启」，先是开场（卡带的名字、编号、入手的日子），再一段一段放，放完停在最后一段的画面；下屏的胶片条点哪格放哪格，划一下起一阵风；「卡带证」上有编号和日子，2027 年 1 月 1 日（含）以前买的金卡带还有「首发版」的印。月付、年付的卡带跟着订阅，订阅停了就收回去，再订就回来；金卡带一直在。游戏、存档、备份和别的功能不用典藏卡带。换了手机或重装以后，在那一页点「恢复购买」；订阅在「管理订阅」里取消。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "系统设置里的「典藏卡带」：月付带铜卡带，年付带银卡带，一次买断带金卡带。有了任何一张，都多出全部机身配色（免费的是前 %lld 种）、相机的全部机型（免费的是前 %lld 种）、每个游戏不限个数的存档位（免费的是前 %lld 个）、存档同步、TV模式（游戏画面放到电视上，iPhone 当手柄），和游戏里的倍速；带小锁的就是典藏卡带的，点它会带你到那一页。三张卡带各放各的动画：放进掌机、按「开启」，先是开场（卡带的名字、编号、入手的日子），再一段一段放，放完停在最后一段的画面；下屏的胶片条点哪格放哪格，划一下起一阵风；「卡带证」上有编号和日子，2027 年 1 月 1 日（含）以前买的金卡带还有「首发版」的印。月付、年付的卡带跟着订阅，订阅停了就收回去，再订就回来；金卡带一直在。游戏、存档、备份和别的功能不用典藏卡带。换了手机或重装以后，在那一页点「恢复购买」；订阅在「管理订阅」里取消。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Collector’s Cartridges in System Settings: Monthly brings the Bronze Cartridge, Yearly the Silver Cartridge, and the one-time purchase the Gold Cartridge. With any one of them you get every shell colour (the first %lld are free), every camera model (the first %lld are free), any number of save slots per game (the first %lld are free), Save Sync, TV Mode (the game on the TV, the iPhone as the controller), and Speed in games; anything with a small lock needs a Collector’s Cartridge, and tapping it takes you to that page. Each cartridge plays films of its own: put it into the handheld and press Start. First comes the opening (the cartridge’s name, its number and the day it became yours), then the films one by one, the last one’s picture staying when they have played; tap a picture on the strip on the lower screen to play that film, and swipe a finger for a gust of wind. The Cartridge Pass shows the number and the day, and a Gold Cartridge bought on or before January 1, 2027 carries the Launch Edition stamp. The Monthly and Yearly cartridges go with the subscription: taken back when it ends, back again when you subscribe again; the Gold Cartridge stays. Games, saves, Backup and everything else work without a cartridge. After changing phones or reinstalling, tap Restore Purchases on that page; cancel a subscription under Manage Subscription."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "还没有记录。开启一个软件（演示也算），玩的时间会记在这里：在前台、开着盖的时间才算。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "还没有记录。开启一个软件（演示也算），玩的时间会记在这里：在前台、开着盖的时间才算。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nothing recorded yet. Start a title (the demo counts) and its play time is kept here — only time in the foreground with the lid open counts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
