            "value": "Colours (library and HOME Menu)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这几种配色换游戏库的纸面，也换掌机屏幕上主菜单和程序的颜色（游戏库里、游戏里都是；相机、相册、游戏笔记不变）。机身配色换掌机的颜色，游戏库里的掌机和游戏里的掌机一起换。手柄样式是手柄模式、外屏上的按键怎么摆。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这几种配色换游戏库的纸面，也换掌机屏幕上主菜单和程序的颜色（游戏库里、游戏里都是；相机、相册、游戏笔记不变）。机身配色换掌机的颜色，游戏库里的掌机和游戏里的掌机一起换。手柄样式是手柄模式、外屏上的按键怎么摆。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These colour schemes change the library’s paper and the colours of the HOME Menu and programs on the handheld’s screens (in the library and in games; Camera, Album and Game Notes stay). Shell colour changes the handheld itself, in the library and in games together. Controller style is how the buttons are laid out in Controller mode and on the cover screen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "竖 %@ · 横 %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "竖 %@ · 横 %@"
          }
