            "state": "translated",
            "value": " (default)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "竖着拿、横着拿和外屏各选各的。竖着拿默认是掌机机身；选了别的样式，Duo 竖过来就换成那一款。上屏是光标停着的那一种，游戏里换了马上生效。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "竖着拿、横着拿和外屏各选各的。竖着拿默认是掌机机身；选了别的样式，Duo 竖过来就换成那一款。上屏是光标停着的那一种，游戏里换了马上生效。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Upright, sideways and the cover screen each have their own. Upright defaults to the handheld body; choose another style and the Duo switches to it when turned upright. The upper screen shows the one under the cursor; changed in a game it takes effect at once."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "竖着拿、横着拿各选各的；上屏是光标停着的那一种。游戏里换了马上生效。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "竖着拿、横着拿各选各的；上屏是光标停着的那一种。游戏里换了马上生效。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Upright and sideways each have their own; the upper screen shows the one under the cursor. Changed in a game it takes effect at once."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@换成了「%@」": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@换成了「%@」"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ changed to “%@”"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在游戏库里按住一张游戏卡把它拿起来，朝离开掌机的方向拖出架子边缘，它就开始碎；全碎了松手就删除，几秒内可以撤销。这里选它掉进什么里。上屏演示的是光标停着的那一种。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在游戏库里按住一张游戏卡把它拿起来，朝离开掌机的方向拖出架子边缘，它就开始碎；全碎了松手就删除，几秒内可以撤销。这里选它掉进什么里。上屏演示的是光标停着的那一种。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In the library, hold a game card to pick it up, then drag it away from the console and over the shelf's edge: it starts to break up. Let go once it is all in pieces and it is deleted; Undo is offered for a few seconds. Choose here what it goes into. The upper screen plays the one under the cursor."
          }
        }
      }
    },
