        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Colours with a lock need a Collector’s Cartridge: tap one to preview it on the upper screen, tap again to see the cartridges."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "两种颜色的配色（比如「粉·白」）：面板是第二种颜色，铰链、边框和背面是第一种。想要整台一个颜色，选单色的。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "两种颜色的配色（比如「粉·白」）：面板是第二种颜色，铰链、边框和背面是第一种。想要整台一个颜色，选单色的。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In a two-colour scheme (say “Pink · White”) the panels take the second colour and the hinge, frame and back the first. For one colour all over, pick a single-colour scheme."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」是典藏卡带的配色：再点一次看典藏卡带": {
