    "上了漆的铁皮，盒盖里印着乘法口诀表，课程表插在塑料套里。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上了漆的铁皮，盒盖里印着乘法口诀表，课程表插在塑料套里。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Painted tin. The times table is printed inside the lid; the class timetable sits in a plastic sleeve."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "亮面塑料，鼓鼓的边。盒盖里有小镜子和彩色拼音表，侧面三个小按键。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "亮面塑料，鼓鼓的边。盒盖里有小镜子和彩色拼音表，侧面三个小按键。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Glossy plastic with chunky edges. Inside the lid: a little mirror and a colourful pinyin chart. Three small buttons on the side."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "木框、枫木内板，铜合页、铜包角。盒盖里一张《静夜思》，一片压干的枫叶。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "木框、枫木内板，铜合页、铜包角。盒盖里一张《静夜思》，一片压干的枫叶。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A wooden frame with maple panels, a brass hinge and brass corners. Inside the lid: a card with a Tang poem and a pressed maple leaf."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "布面硬壳，一圈拉链。盒盖里一个网兜，课程表放在透明窗里。": {
