            "state": "translated",
            "value": " (only while software is paused)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "游戏库右下角的小铅笔盒（主菜单里也有它的图标）：一只老铁皮文具盒。打开以后，上屏是盒盖里面，印着乘法口诀表，旁边是攒到的东西，还没攒到的用铅笔画个框，写着还差几张；下屏是盒子里的托盘，没贴出去的东西放在大格子里，点红布条翻到下一层。点一样东西，可以贴到盒盖上，或放回铅笔盒。底下的「照片」从掌机相册或 iPhone 照片里挑一张贴上（iPhone 照片只拿你选的那几张）；「游戏笔记」挑一页写过的便签贴上；「写便条」用手指或 Apple Pencil 写，也能打字，字是手写体（第一次用时 iPhone 会下载一次这种字体）。照片按住选「换一张」，在原来的位置换成别的照片。托盘里有一把尺子和三支铅笔（绿、红、蓝），都能贴到盒盖上；按住一支铅笔拖到卷笔刀的口上，它就转着削起来，削下的木屑落进卷笔刀的小窗，削短了松手就换一支新的；点一下小窗里的木屑，贴一片到盒盖上。点红按钮，笔架立起来，三支铅笔插在笔架上。两根红色松紧带可以拨一下，会弹一两下，下面压着的照片露出来。开着铅笔盒合上手机，外屏就是这只铅笔盒的盒盖，样式和颜色跟里面的一样（开着掌机合上，外屏是同一配色的掌机外壳）：一根手指拖动；两根手指转动、缩放刚碰过的那一样；点一下，八音盒放小曲，照片和便条放大看——照片左右划着换一张，便条点「打字接着写」；按住出菜单（换一张、放回铅笔盒、摆正、大一点、小一点）。再打开手机，铅笔盒还开着。没有外屏的 iPhone，点盒盖里的「合上盒盖」看外面，摆法一样，「打开盒盖」回来。卡带架上自己导入的游戏多起来（演示卡不算），盒子里就多一样小东西——1 张：小红花印章，便签里也能盖；3 张：棒棒糖，相册编辑的贴画里也有；5 张：八音盒；8 张：作业本格子纸，便签和便条多一种纸；12 张：自行车、书包、落叶。得到的东西一直留着，删了游戏也不会收回。不用典藏卡带。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏库右下角的小铅笔盒（主菜单里也有它的图标）：一只老铁皮文具盒。打开以后，上屏是盒盖里面，印着乘法口诀表，旁边是攒到的东西，还没攒到的用铅笔画个框，写着还差几张；下屏是盒子里的托盘，没贴出去的东西放在大格子里，点红布条翻到下一层。点一样东西，可以贴到盒盖上，或放回铅笔盒。底下的「照片」从掌机相册或 iPhone 照片里挑一张贴上（iPhone 照片只拿你选的那几张）；「游戏笔记」挑一页写过的便签贴上；「写便条」用手指或 Apple Pencil 写，也能打字，字是手写体（第一次用时 iPhone 会下载一次这种字体）。照片按住选「换一张」，在原来的位置换成别的照片。托盘里有一把尺子和三支铅笔（绿、红、蓝），都能贴到盒盖上；按住一支铅笔拖到卷笔刀的口上，它就转着削起来，削下的木屑落进卷笔刀的小窗，削短了松手就换一支新的；点一下小窗里的木屑，贴一片到盒盖上。点红按钮，笔架立起来，三支铅笔插在笔架上。两根红色松紧带可以拨一下，会弹一两下，下面压着的照片露出来。开着铅笔盒合上手机，外屏就是这只铅笔盒的盒盖，样式和颜色跟里面的一样（开着掌机合上，外屏是同一配色的掌机外壳）：一根手指拖动；两根手指转动、缩放刚碰过的那一样；点一下，八音盒放小曲，照片和便条放大看——照片左右划着换一张，便条点「打字接着写」；按住出菜单（换一张、放回铅笔盒、摆正、大一点、小一点）。再打开手机，铅笔盒还开着。没有外屏的 iPhone，点盒盖里的「合上盒盖」看外面，摆法一样，「打开盒盖」回来。卡带架上自己导入的游戏多起来（演示卡不算），盒子里就多一样小东西——1 张：小红花印章，便签里也能盖；3 张：棒棒糖，相册编辑的贴画里也有；5 张：八音盒；8 张：作业本格子纸，便签和便条多一种纸；12 张：自行车、书包、落叶。得到的东西一直留着，删了游戏也不会收回。不用典藏卡带。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The little pencil box in the library’s lower right corner (also among the HOME Menu’s icons): an old tin pencil box. Open it and the upper screen is the inside of its lid, the multiplication table printed on it and what you have gathered beside it — what is still to come is drawn round in pencil with how many more games it wants; the lower screen is the tray inside, where what is not on the lid waits in the big well; the red ribbon turns to the next layer. Tap a thing to stick it on the lid, or put it back in the box. Along the foot, Photo puts up a picture from the console’s album or from iPhone Photos (only the photos you choose reach the app); Game Notes puts up a written page of the pad; Write a note lets you write with a finger or Apple Pencil, or type — in a handwriting typeface, which iPhone downloads once the first time. Hold a photo and choose Change photo to put another in its place. In the tray lie a ruler and three pencils (green, red, blue), and all of them can go on the lid; hold a pencil and drag it to the sharpener’s mouth and it turns and sharpens, the shavings falling into the sharpener’s little window — when it gets too short, let go and a new one takes its place; tap the shavings in the window to stick one on the lid. Press the red button and the rack stands up, the three pencils in it. Pluck either red strap and it bounces once or twice, showing the photos under it. Close the phone with the pencil box open and the cover is its lid, in the same style and colour (closed with the console open, the cover is the console’s shell in the same finish): one finger moves a thing; two fingers turn and size the one touched last; a tap makes the music box play and brings a photo or a note up close — swipe a photo for another, tap Type on it for a note; hold for Change photo, Back in the box, Straighten, Bigger, Smaller. Open the phone again and the pencil box is still open. On an iPhone without a cover, tap Close the lid inside the box to see its outside, arranged the same way; Open the lid brings you back. As games of your own fill the shelf (the demo card does not count), small things come into the box — 1 game: a red flower stamp, which stamps in Sticky Notes too; 3: a lollipop, also a sticker for the Album’s editing; 5: a music box; 8: squared exercise paper, a new paper for Sticky Notes and notes; 12: a bicycle, a school bag and a fallen leaf. What comes stays, even if games leave the shelf. No Collector’s Cartridge needed."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "游戏里按 HOME：游戏暂停，下屏是同一个主菜单，第一个图标是正在玩的软件（「继续游戏」「关闭软件」），上屏是它暂停时的画面。主菜单上面一排小图标：保存进度（把这个软件此刻的样子整个存下来，叫即时存档，和游戏自己的存档无关）、读取进度（回到上次保存进度的那一刻）、存档位（每个游戏有好几个，保存和读取用的是选中的那一个）、游戏笔记、屏幕亮度、画面滤镜、按键点屏、倍速；放哪几个，在系统设置 › 其他设置（第 5 页）›「主菜单顶上的按键」里选，铅笔盒也能放上来。相机、相册、设置、游戏记录、主题、说明书、游玩模式和小图标里的游戏笔记都可以在游戏暂停时直接打开，不换模式，HOME 回到主菜单；只有格式化主机和移除正在玩的软件要先关闭它。导入在游戏库的主菜单里。再按一次 HOME 继续游戏。按 POWER 不进菜单：保存进度（即时存档）后直接回游戏库，掌机带着游戏最后的画面缩回台子上；下次在游戏库里「继续上次」就接着玩。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏里按 HOME：游戏暂停，下屏是同一个主菜单，第一个图标是正在玩的软件（「继续游戏」「关闭软件」），上屏是它暂停时的画面。主菜单上面一排小图标：保存进度（把这个软件此刻的样子整个存下来，叫即时存档，和游戏自己的存档无关）、读取进度（回到上次保存进度的那一刻）、存档位（每个游戏有好几个，保存和读取用的是选中的那一个）、游戏笔记、屏幕亮度、画面滤镜、按键点屏、倍速；放哪几个，在系统设置 › 其他设置（第 5 页）›「主菜单顶上的按键」里选，铅笔盒也能放上来。相机、相册、设置、游戏记录、主题、说明书、游玩模式和小图标里的游戏笔记都可以在游戏暂停时直接打开，不换模式，HOME 回到主菜单；只有格式化主机和移除正在玩的软件要先关闭它。导入在游戏库的主菜单里。再按一次 HOME 继续游戏。按 POWER 不进菜单：保存进度（即时存档）后直接回游戏库，掌机带着游戏最后的画面缩回台子上；下次在游戏库里「继续上次」就接着玩。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Press HOME in a game: the game pauses, the lower screen shows the same HOME Menu with the running software as its first icon (Continue, Close software), and the upper screen shows the game as it paused. The small icons above the menu: Save state (keeps this title exactly as it is now — a save state, separate from the game’s own saves), Load state (back to the moment of the last save), Save Slot (each game has several; saving and loading use the chosen one), Game Notes, Brightness, Screen filter, Key taps, Speed; which of them are there is chosen in System Settings › Other Settings (page 5) › HOME top-row buttons, where the Pencil Box can be added too. Camera, Album, Settings, Activity Log, Themes, Manual, Play Modes and Game Notes all open while the game is paused, without changing mode; HOME returns to the menu. Only formatting the system and removing the running software need it closed first. Import is on the library’s menu. Press HOME again to continue. POWER skips the menu: it saves a state and goes straight back to the library, the handheld shrinking back onto its stand with the game’s last picture; next time, Resume in the library picks it up."
          }
        }
      }
    },
