    "看看这台 iPhone 现在有没有网络。Zero EMU 没有账号，也没有自己的服务器：游戏、存档和设置都在本机；存档同步是可选的，走你自己的 iCloud。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "See whether this iPhone is online. Zero EMU has no accounts and no server of its own: games, saves and settings stay on this device; save sync is optional and goes through your own iCloud."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "看看这台 iPhone 现在有没有网络。Zero EMU 没有账号，也没有自己的服务器：游戏、存档和设置都在本机；存档同步是可选的，走你自己的 iCloud。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zero EMU 自己的服务器": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zero EMU’s own servers"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zero EMU 自己的服务器"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "游戏、存档和设置都存在这台 iPhone 上，Zero EMU 没有自己的服务器，也不收集数据。购买走 App Store；存档同步是可选的，走你自己的 iCloud。软件自己想上网的功能（在线对战、商店）在模拟的主机里连不上。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Games, saves and settings are kept on this iPhone; Zero EMU has no server of its own and collects no data. Purchases go through the App Store; save sync is optional and uses your own iCloud. Features in which software itself tries to go online (online play, shops) can’t connect inside the emulated handheld."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏、存档和设置都存在这台 iPhone 上，Zero EMU 没有自己的服务器，也不收集数据。购买走 App Store；存档同步是可选的，走你自己的 iCloud。软件自己想上网的功能（在线对战、商店）在模拟的主机里连不上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "没有账号，没有自己的服务器。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No accounts, no server of its own."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有账号，没有自己的服务器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
