    },
    "这是 Zero EMU 用户协议的摘要。完整文字见下面的链接，以完整文字为准。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这是 Zero EMU 用户协议的摘要。完整文字见下面的链接，以完整文字为准。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This is a summary of the Zero EMU User Agreement. The full text is at the link below, and the full text is what counts."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开源：Zero EMU 的程序代码以 GPL 第 3 版公开，内置的开源组件按各自的许可证授权。你依这些许可证享有的权利，用户协议不限制。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开源：Zero EMU 的程序代码以 GPL 第 3 版公开，内置的开源组件按各自的许可证授权。你依这些许可证享有的权利，用户协议不限制。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open source: Zero EMU’s program code is released under the GPL version 3, and the open-source components inside it are licensed under their own licences. The User Agreement does not limit the rights those licences give you."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "游戏文件：Zero EMU 不含、也不提供任何游戏、固件或密钥。请只导入你有权使用的文件；带加密保护的文件会被拒收。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "游戏文件：Zero EMU 不含、也不提供任何游戏、固件或密钥。请只导入你有权使用的文件；带加密保护的文件会被拒收。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Game files: Zero EMU contains no games, firmware or keys and does not provide any. Please import only files you have the right to use; files with encryption protection are refused."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "购买：付费功能是可选的，走 App Store。月付、年付自动续期，可以在「管理订阅」里取消；退款由 Apple 处理。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "购买：付费功能是可选的，走 App Store。月付、年付自动续期，可以在「管理订阅」里取消；退款由 Apple 处理。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Purchases: paid features are optional and go through the App Store. Monthly and Yearly renew automatically and can be cancelled under Manage Subscription; refunds are handled by Apple."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "其他：Zero EMU 按现状提供，不保证每个游戏都能运行。它没有账号，也没有自己的服务器。它与任何游戏机或游戏的厂商没有关联。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "其他：Zero EMU 按现状提供，不保证每个游戏都能运行。它没有账号，也没有自己的服务器。它与任何游戏机或游戏的厂商没有关联。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Other: Zero EMU is provided as is, and we do not promise that every game will run. It has no accounts and no server of its own. It is not affiliated with any maker of game consoles or games."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "完整的用户协议": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "完整的用户协议"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Full User Agreement"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下次打开 Zero EMU 时，菜单和软件都换成这个语言": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下次打开 Zero EMU 时，菜单和软件都换成这个语言"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The menus and software switch to this language the next time Zero EMU opens"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "菜单和软件用哪种语言显示。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "菜单和软件用哪种语言显示。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Which language the menus and software display in."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "菜单和软件都用这个语言：菜单只有中文和英文，选别的语言时菜单用英文；软件要支持这个语言才会换。下次打开 Zero EMU 时生效。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "菜单和软件都用这个语言：菜单只有中文和英文，选别的语言时菜单用英文；软件要支持这个语言才会换。下次打开 Zero EMU 时生效。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The menus and software both use this language. The menus come in Chinese and English only, so with any other language they are in English; software changes only if it supports the language. Takes effect the next time Zero EMU opens."
          }
        }
      }
    },
